1
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:22,480
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

2
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:15,080
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

3
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:58,240
(Chlorpromazine Hydrochloride Injection)
（盐酸氯丙嗪注射液）

4
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,360
Who is it?
谁呀？

5
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,880
Hualin Public Security Bureau.
桦林公安局的

6
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,800
Ma Desheng.
马德胜

7
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,240
We've met before, in Hualin.
咱们在桦林见过

8
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,880
I remember you, Captain Ma.
有印象，马队长

9
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,160
What brings you to Songhe?
怎么到松河来了？

10
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,880
I was just passing through.
这不是正好路过吗？

11
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:13,320
I'm here to ask you a few things about Shen Mo.
沈墨的事，我来跟你了解点情况

12
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:18,280
Come in.
请进

13
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,680
This way, please.
来，这边请

14
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:29,320
Have a seat.
坐这

15
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,520
A big tiger.
大老虎

16
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:42,120
Looks fierce.
挺凶啊

17
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,520
Borrowing the tiger's might, are we?
狐假虎威吧

18
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,440
How else do you catch tiger cubs without entering the tiger's den?
还不入虎穴，焉得虎子呢

19
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,880
You've got a line for everything.
一套一套的

20
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,480
Captain Ma.
马队长

21
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,640
Sorry to intrude.
打扰了啊

22
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,640
Have a seat.
你坐啊

23
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,880
Smoke?
抽烟吗？

24
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:13,840
I quit.
戒了

25
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:18,320
Shen Mo...
沈墨…

26
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:21,440
How old was she when she came to live with you?
几岁和你们一起生活的呀？

27
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,000
You've asked me before.
你问过我

28
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:29,040
Not quite nine.
九岁不到

29
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,200
Under nine.
不到九岁

30
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,560
How was your relationship?
你们关系怎么样？

31
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:36,120
Did you talk much, day to day?
平时交流得多吗？

32
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,840
What relationship? We're family.
啥关系？ 一家人

33
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:44,160
Why so tense?
怎么紧张呀？

34
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,880
Having a cop in the house feels awkward, right?
警察进家里别扭是不？

35
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:50,280
It's fine, just chatting.
没事，瞎聊聊

36
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,680
Why not stay for a drink at noon?
要不中午你在这喝口？

37
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,440
No, I'm just here for a quick chat.
没有，我就瞎聊两句

38
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,160
It's just, there's this case.
这不这案子在这呢

39
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,240
It's... it's troubling.
它也…它也愁

40
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:04,920
About her...
她这个…

41
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:08,840
Before she went to college in Hualin, did she ever date anyone?
去桦林上大学之前，谈过恋爱吗？

42
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,880
As far as I know,
据我了解

43
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:14,880
no.
没有

44
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,680
No.
没有

45
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,160
Which room was hers? Mind if I take a look?
她住哪屋？ 我能瞅瞅不？

46
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,840
Is that all right?
方便不？

47
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:23,720
It's fine.
方便

48
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,000
This room?
这屋啊？

49
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,200
This room.
这屋

50
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,680
No one lives in this room now?
这屋现在没人住啊？

51
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,200
No.
是

52
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,080
Since Momo left,
墨墨走了

53
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,200
the room's been empty.
这屋子就空了

54
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:49,280
Nice piano.
钢琴不错

55
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,760
It's Shen Mo's, isn't it?
这是沈墨的吧？

56
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,000
You spared no expense.
挺舍得花钱呀

57
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,720
We raised her like our own daughter.
当亲闺女养的嘛

58
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,200
Have some water.
喝口水吧

59
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,040
Have some water.
喝口水

60
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,880
Thanks.
谢谢

61
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,440
You raised Shen Mo so well.
把沈墨养得这么好

62
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,120
Weren't you afraid she'd run into bad people?
不怕她碰到坏人啊？

63
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,720
Captain Ma, the way you talk...
马队长，你这嗑唠的

64
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,840
Isn't that what you police are for?
不是还有你们警察吗？

65
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:44,440
(Labor Union)
（工会）

66
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,360
You work at the No. 2 Textile Mill, right?
我记着你在二纺厂工作是吧？

67
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:49,560
Yes, I drive for the labor union.
对，在工会开车

68
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,680
Let's talk somewhere else.
咱俩换个地唠唠

69
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:26,760
This money order matures on the 17th.
这张汇票的承兑日期是17号

70
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,920
Which is today.
也就是今天

71
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,440
The bank opens at nine.
银行九点钟上班

72
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,920
I'll take one team inside the bank.
我带一组人在银行里

73
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,000
Two more teams cover the north and south intersections.
南北、两个路口由两组人守住

74
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,360
A sum this large,
这么大一笔钱

75
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:37,280
whoever dared go once will surely go a second time.
这个人敢去第一次 就一定会再去第二次

76
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,280
Besides the bank,
除了银行

77
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:41,320
the train station, the bus station — every transit hub in and out of Hualin
火车站、汽车站 所有能出入桦林的交通枢纽

78
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,000
is already staffed in advance.
都已经提前安排好人了

79
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:45,480
Today, no one gets out of Hualin.
保证今天谁也跑不出桦林

80
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,720
Who let you in?
谁让你进来的？

81
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,880
I'm looking for Captain Ma.
我找马队

82
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,080
Master Wang.
王师傅

83
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,160
Outside.
门口

84
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:57,120
Director Zhu.
朱局

85
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,320
A moment, outside.
门口一下

86
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,880
You... go on.
你…你接着说

87
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,320
Captain Ma went to Songhe yesterday.
马队昨天去松河了

88
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,680
Did he say when he'd be back?
没说啥时候回来？

89
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,960
He should be back tonight.
今天晚上应该能回来

90
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,800
What is it? You can tell me.
啥事？ 你跟我说吧

91
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,200
Fine, later then.
行，完了再说

92
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,280
Everything okay?
没事？

93
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,480
It's fine.
没事

94
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,040
What've you got there?
拿的啥呀？

95
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:30,920
Groceries from the market.
菜市场买菜

96
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:32,920
-Really nothing?
-Nothing...
-真没事？
-没事…

97
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,640
Look at you, drenched in sweat.
你瞅你这一脑袋汗

98
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,360
Walked too fast. Go on back.
走急了，回吧

99
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,160
-Really nothing?
-Nothing. Go back.
-真没事？
-没事，回去吧

100
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,640
Yang'er.
阳儿

101
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,280
Want something to eat?
吃点不？

102
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,080
I'll fry you an egg.
妈给你煎个鸡蛋

103
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,120
Mom.
妈

104
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,200
I feel awful.
我难受

105
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,600
Where does it hurt?
哪难受啊？

106
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,800
My head aches.
头疼

107
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:08,160
Did you bump it yesterday?
是不是昨天磕着了呀？

108
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:17,960
Let me see.
我看看

109
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:29,280
Did you hit it somewhere?
是不磕哪了？

110
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,360
Have some water.
喝点水

111
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,360
Let Mom rub it for you.
妈给你按按啊

112
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,480
What kind of pain is it?
是怎么疼法啊？

113
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:58,400
Is it throbbing, or does it come in waves?
是一跳一跳的还是一阵一阵疼？

114
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,640
Throbbing.
跳着疼

115
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:04,120
I just slept badly.
就是没睡好

116
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,200
Here, eat something.
来，吃点东西啊

117
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,040
-Come on.
-I'm not hungry.
-来
-我不饿

118
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,360
The way you're...
你这么…

119
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,320
Not eating, not drinking — how could you not be hungry?
不吃不喝的，能不饿吗？

120
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,520
Don't cry, Mom.
妳别哭啊，妈

121
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:25,640
I'm fine.
我没事

122
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:30,280
Trussed up like this, how could you be fine?
谁这么五花大绑能没事？

123
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,720
Mom, loosen these for me a little.
妈，妳帮我松快松快吧

124
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,120
Okay.
好

125
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:57,960
Your hands...
这手

126
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,400
Yang'er.
阳儿

127
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,480
Your dad's not here.
你爸没在

128
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,480
Tell Mom.
你跟妈说说吧

129
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,160
What's really wrong with you?
你到底怎么的了？

130
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:18,000
Mom.
妈

131
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,080
I want a bowl of water-rinsed rice.
我想吃碗水捞饭

132
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:25,040
Okay, Mom will go make it.
行，妈给你做去啊

133
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:33,280
Here, Yang'er.
来，阳儿

134
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,960
Eat slowly.
你慢点吃

135
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,320
Mom.
妈

136
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,880
My quilt feels a bit thin.
我那被子好像有点薄

137
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:04,520
It gets drafty at night.
夜里有点飕得慌

138
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:08,720
Didn't I just switch you to a thick quilt the other day?
这前两天不刚给你换了厚被子吗？

139
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:12,480
Maybe the cotton's shifted out of the corner.
可能被角的棉花跑了

140
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,520
Let me check, I'll find you another one.
那我看看，再给你找一床啊

141
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,200
Mom.
妈

142
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,160
I'm sorry.
对不起

143
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:55,600
Yang'er... what are you doing?
阳儿…你干啥？

144
00:14:55,680 --> 00:14:56,880
Yang'er, open the door.
阳儿，你开门

145
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,960
Yang'er... let Mom out.
阳儿…你让妈出去

146
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:01,640
Yang'er, whatever you do, don't run.
阳儿，你千万别跑

147
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,760
Whatever it is, wait until your dad's back.
你有啥事，等你爸回来再说啊

148
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,720
Yang'er.
阳儿

149
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:05,840
Mom.
妈

150
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,680
I have to go out.
我必须得出去一趟

151
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,360
I made this mistake; I have to fix it myself.
我自己犯的错，我得自己解决

152
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,320
Wait for me.
妳等着我

153
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:17,200
I'll come back, I promise.
我一定回来

154
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:19,160
Yang'er... don't run.
阳儿…你别跑

155
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,120
Yang'er, open the door.
阳儿，你开门

156
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:22,560
Wang Yang...
王阳…

157
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:25,680
Open the door, Wang Yang...
你开开门呀，王阳…

158
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:28,600
Wang Yang, don't run.
王阳，你别跑

159
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:30,560
Wang Yang.
王阳

160
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,800
Wang Yang.
王阳

161
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:47,000
Wang Yang, open the door.
王阳，开门呀

162
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:51,160
Wang Yang...
王阳…

163
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:54,680
Wang Yang...
王阳…

164
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:01,880
Where's Wang Yang?
王阳呢？

165
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,720
He ran. I couldn't hold him.
跑了，没看住

166
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,440
How could you not even keep an eye on him?
妳怎么连个人都看不住？

167
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,440
What do we do?
怎么办啊？

168
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:10,200
Where do we even look?
上哪找去啊？

169
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,400
Stop wailing.
别嗷嗷了

170
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,280
Let me think.
我想想

171
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,360
Hello?
喂？

172
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:39,840
Please page 9652827.
请呼9652827

173
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:44,760
Say, "Wang Xiang has important information to report.
说“王响有重要情况汇报

174
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:45,960
Please call back at once."
请速速回电”

175
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,720
Do you have children, Captain Ma?
你有孩子吗，马队长？

176
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,840
As a cop, you see too many bastards.
当警察王八蛋见得太多

177
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:03,000
Would you dare have any?
敢生吗？

178
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,000
True enough.
也是

179
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,600
I have a son too, named Shen Hui.
我还有个儿子，叫沉辉

180
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,280
Honestly, my feelings for Momo...
其实我对墨墨…

181
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:15,560
I care more for Momo than for that son.
对墨墨的感情比对这个儿子感情深

182
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,200
You know,
你知道

183
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:23,760
this child lost both her parents.
这孩子爹妈都没了

184
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,800
I raised her for ten years.
在我这养了十年呀

185
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,280
Ten years.
十年

186
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,160
You could say
可以这么讲

187
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,960
I gave her the very best.
我把最好的都给了她

188
00:17:33,040 --> 00:17:34,359
Good food, good clothes.
好吃、好穿

189
00:17:35,639 --> 00:17:37,359
I even bought her a piano.
我还给她买了钢琴

190
00:17:43,399 --> 00:17:44,800
Once you bring it up,
一提这个呀

191
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:47,000
I can't even...
不能提…

192
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:54,360
No man in this world could ever be as good to her as I was.
这个世上没有任何一个男人 能像我对她这么好

193
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,480
No one.
没有

194
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:01,920
Good in what way?
哪种好啊？

195
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:11,200
Someone took nude photos of Shen Mo and wrote a denunciation letter.
有人给沈墨拍裸照，写举报信

196
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:13,240
Posted it right on the notice board at Hualin Medical.
就贴在桦医的宣传栏上

197
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:14,880
You must know about this, right?
这事你肯定知道吧？

198
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:20,360
Who could do such a thing?
谁能干出这样的事来呀？

199
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,960
Could it be someone close to her?
不会就是她身边的人吧？

200
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:24,640
Wanting to control her, taking nude photos.
想控制她，拍裸照

201
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,440
Treating her like a plaything.
把她当玩物

202
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,720
And Shen Mo didn't dare resist.
沈墨又不敢反抗

203
00:18:33,560 --> 00:18:36,240
A child grows up one day.
孩子总有长大的一天

204
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:39,520
She'd surely want to break free of that control.
肯定是想摆脱这种控制

205
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:41,280
But that person wouldn't have it.
可这个人就不干了

206
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:45,320
Wouldn't you say such a person deserves to die a thousand deaths?
你说这人是不是罪该万死？

207
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,080
Captain Ma, if you have something to say, say it straight.
马队长，你有什么你就直说

208
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,320
Don't beat around the bush.
别绕弯子

209
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:52,480
There's a kettle in that photo, isn't there?
这照片上不是有个水壶吗？

210
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:54,920
Doesn't it look familiar?
看着是不是挺眼熟？

211
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:57,480
I saw an identical one in your house.
我在你们家看着个一模一样的

212
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,840
Explain that to me.
你给我解释解释这事

213
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,760
This kettle?
就这水壶啊？

214
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,920
You're really something.
你可真招笑

215
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:09,000
At our No. 2 Textile Mill, every household has one just like it.
在我们二纺厂 家家户户都有这么一把

216
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,360
What you want to ask me is
你是想问我

217
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:13,560
whether I took that photo, right?
这照片是不是我拍的吧？

218
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,840
Did you take it?
是不是你拍的？

219
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:20,520
You're a policeman.
你是警察

220
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:22,240
How can you even ask me that?
你怎么还能问我呢？

221
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:23,640
Let me tell you, Shen Dongliang,
我告诉你，沉栋梁

222
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,840
I'll investigate this case to the very end.
这案子我会一查到底

223
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:26,960
Not just the murderer —
不光是杀人凶手

224
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:29,520
any monstrous, evil deed, I'll pursue to the very end.
任何伤天害理的事，我都会一查到底

225
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:33,600
Good, then I'm reassured.
好，那我就放心了

226
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:37,960
When you've cracked it,
到时候你查明白了

227
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:39,640
I'll send you a banner of honor.
我给你送个锦旗

228
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,080
Don't be in such a hurry.
别着急呀

229
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:43,040
Once we're in Hualin, we'll talk at leisure.
到了桦林，咱慢慢聊

230
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:44,040
Sure.
好啊

231
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,680
In Hualin,
到桦林

232
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,440
in Hualin, when I meet your superiors,
到桦林我跟你们领导

233
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,840
I'll ask them properly:
见了面我好好问一问

234
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,720
as a people's policeman,
你作为人民警察

235
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,440
how exactly do you serve the people?
你是怎么为人民的？

236
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:58,000
Like this... just like this,
就这…就这么

237
00:19:58,080 --> 00:20:02,280
shoving a victim's family member into a car to interrogate him without authorization.
擅自地把受害人的家属 怼到车里来讯问

238
00:20:02,360 --> 00:20:04,160
I really must ask your superiors
我到底要问问你们领导

239
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:07,600
whether this befits the conduct of a people's policeman,
这符不符合一个人民警察的行为

240
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:10,840
whether it's in line with your... your regulations.
符不符合你们…你们的规定

241
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:20,120
You know what I regretted most back then?
我当时最遗憾的你知道是什么吗？

242
00:20:20,200 --> 00:20:22,440
You know what I regret most of all?
我最后悔的你知道是什么吗？

243
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,920
What I regret most is
我最后悔的就是

244
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,880
that she didn't die by my hand.
她没死我手里

245
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:32,640
Look at that.
你看看

246
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:34,560
Back then,
那时候

247
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,280
so pure.
多干净啊

248
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:38,760
You fucking animal.
你他妈个畜生你

249
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,000
You're not even human.
不是人的玩意

250
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,640
Get out.
下来

251
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,120
Get over here.
给我过来

252
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:04,000
Pure?
干净？

253
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,480
Damn.
我去

254
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,160
Go.
去

255
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:14,720
Damn.
我去

256
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,600
Fuck.
操

257
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,840
Fuck.
我操

258
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,120
Fuck.
操

259
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:35,920
This is all you've fucking got?
你他妈就这么大点能耐了？

260
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:39,400
Can't crack the case, huh?
查不明白案子是吧？

261
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:43,840
So you take it out on the victim's family?
就拿受害人家属撒气呀？

262
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:45,720
Come on...
来…

263
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,440
Still fucking putting on an act.
他妈还装呢

264
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,520
The police are beating people!
警察打人了

265
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:08,960
The police are beating people!
警察打人了

266
00:22:09,040 --> 00:22:11,080
Somebody, help!
来人啊

267
00:22:18,360 --> 00:22:20,880
The police are beating people!
警察打人了

268
00:22:27,800 --> 00:22:29,000
Damn.
我去

269
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:44,880
Fuck.
操

270
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,760
Ma Desheng.
马德胜

271
00:23:03,600 --> 00:23:04,600
Ma Desheng.
马德胜

272
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:08,040
This case,
这案子

273
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:09,920
you can't solve it.
你破不了

274
00:23:11,520 --> 00:23:12,760
Do you know what they call...
知道啥叫…

275
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:16,840
Do you know what "dead men tell no tales" means?
你知道啥叫死无对证吗？

276
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,560
You fucking...
你他妈的

277
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:41,440
Come on...
来…

278
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,600
Come on.
来

279
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:19,080
Boss, another plate of dumplings.
老板，再来一份饺子

280
00:24:38,120 --> 00:24:39,800
Do you remember when we were kids,
妳还记不记得咱俩小时候

281
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:44,080
how at night when I was hungry I'd sneak into the kitchen for food?
晚上我饿了去厨房偷东西吃？

282
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:49,680
Dad caught me and was going to hit me,
咱爸看见了要打我

283
00:24:49,760 --> 00:24:51,760
but you insisted it was you who ate it.
妳非说是妳吃的

284
00:24:51,840 --> 00:24:53,920
In the end Dad gave me a beating anyway.
结果咱爸打了我一顿

285
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:05,400
Why bring this up all of a sudden?
怎么突然说这个？

286
00:25:07,840 --> 00:25:10,320
These dumplings taste just like the ones from back then.
这个饺子和小时候吃的味道一样

287
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:46,600
My stomach's upset.
我肚子不舒服

288
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:49,600
I'm going to the restroom; wait for me here.
我去下厕所，妳在这等我

289
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:51,760
Do you want anything else to eat?
妳还要吃什么吗？

290
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:55,560
Cheer up.
开心点

291
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:57,240
Smile.
要笑

292
00:26:33,840 --> 00:26:35,000
One moment, please.
您稍等一下

293
00:26:39,320 --> 00:26:40,320
Wire 200.
汇200

294
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:24,000
Boss, the check.
老板，结帐

295
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:37,040
Don't move...
别动…

296
00:27:37,120 --> 00:27:38,040
Hold him down.
摁住

297
00:27:38,120 --> 00:27:39,080
Cuff him...
铐上…

298
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,280
-Hold him down.
-Cuff him.
-摁住
-铐上

299
00:27:40,360 --> 00:27:41,520
Behave.
老实点

300
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:56,920
(If I don't come back, leave with Wang Yang)
（如果我没回来，跟王阳一起走）

301
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,280
(I'll take all the blame)
（我会承担一切）

302
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,560
Move...
走…

303
00:29:22,600 --> 00:29:24,120
What's the matter, Master Wang?
怎么的了，王师傅？

304
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:27,640
Last time you said
你上回说

305
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:30,080
you'd repay me if I introduced you to Huang Liru.
让我介绍黄丽茹给你，完了报答我

306
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:31,760
Does that still stand?
这个事算数不？

307
00:29:32,840 --> 00:29:34,160
It stands.
算数啊

308
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:36,120
Play it right and you might end up my brother-in-law.
整不好以后你都我姐夫了

309
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:37,320
Of course it stands.
必须算数

310
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:38,880
Here's your chance.
机会来了

311
00:29:39,520 --> 00:29:41,040
Come catch someone with me tonight.
晚上跟我去抓人

312
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:43,120
Catch who?
抓谁呀？

313
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,280
My son.
我儿子

314
00:29:46,080 --> 00:29:49,120
The boy's been led astray by a bunch of bad kids.
这小子被一帮坏孩子给带坏了

315
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,520
Tonight they might run off together.
晚上没准一起跑

316
00:29:52,600 --> 00:29:54,480
No, Master Wang, you don't get it.
不，王师傅，你不知道

317
00:29:54,560 --> 00:29:56,680
These half-grown kids nowadays, they hit hard.
就现在那半大小子，下手挺黑

318
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,320
If it comes to blows,
你这要咔咔弄起来

319
00:29:58,400 --> 00:29:59,520
the two of us might be no match.
咱俩未必是对手

320
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:00,720
What are you saying?
你啥意思？

321
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:03,640
Why not give Captain Ma a heads-up?
要不你给马队长打个招呼？

322
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:05,000
Have him send two men along with us.
让他派两人跟着咱俩

323
00:30:05,080 --> 00:30:06,600
Can't reach Captain Ma.
马队联系不上

324
00:30:10,480 --> 00:30:12,560
Does my sister know about this?
那咱家我姐知道这事不？

325
00:30:13,600 --> 00:30:15,040
If you're going to marry Liru,
你要娶丽茹

326
00:30:15,120 --> 00:30:17,000
not only is my wife your sister,
不光我媳妇是你姐

327
00:30:17,080 --> 00:30:18,680
my son is your nephew too.
我儿子也是你外甥

328
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:20,760
An uncle's word carries weight.
娘亲舅大

329
00:30:20,840 --> 00:30:21,920
Are you in or not?
这事管不管？

330
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,200
I'm in.
我管

331
00:30:23,280 --> 00:30:25,200
-For my own nephew, I have to be.
-Good.
-为我亲外甥，我必须管
-好

332
00:30:25,280 --> 00:30:26,920
Tell me, how do I help?
你说吧，怎么帮？

333
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:03,120
-How's it going?
-Watch this — here, one for you, here.
-怎么样？
-看着，来…给你来一个，来

334
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:04,600
What's that?
啥玩意？

335
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,120
Hello.
你好

336
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:10,160
Could you tell me which room Gong Biao lives in?
我想问一下龚彪住哪屋呀？

337
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:11,760
-Gong Biao — Biaozi?
-Yes.
-龚彪，彪子吗？
-对

338
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:13,560
-The one from the plant office?
-Yes.
-厂办那个？
-对

339
00:31:13,640 --> 00:31:14,800
Turn left, room two-two-two.
左拐，三个二

340
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:16,120
Okay, thanks.
好，谢谢啊

341
00:31:20,520 --> 00:31:22,000
Haven't we met somewhere?
咱俩是不是在哪见过？

342
00:31:22,080 --> 00:31:23,200
Have we?
见过吗？

343
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:24,240
I don't remember.
我怎么没印象啊？

344
00:31:24,320 --> 00:31:25,400
Aren't you a nurse at the plant hospital?
妳是不是厂医院的护士？

345
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,280
You gave me a shot once — it didn't hurt at all.
妳给我打过针，妳打的一点都不疼

346
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:28,400
Really?
是吗？

347
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:42,160
What's with your attitude?
你什么态度呢？

348
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:50,280
What's with the attitude?
什么态度呢？

349
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:52,560
What's with the attitude?
什么态度呢？

350
00:32:19,840 --> 00:32:22,040
Hear me? Don't you point fingers at me.
听见没？ 别给我指指点点的啊

351
00:32:28,760 --> 00:32:29,720
Biaozi.
彪子

352
00:32:30,600 --> 00:32:32,240
Hey, stop knocking.
不是，别敲了

353
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:33,400
Didn't I say no games today?
我不说今天不玩了吗？

354
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:35,080
Someone's here for you, hurry.
有人找你，快点

355
00:32:36,280 --> 00:32:37,320
Who is it?
谁呀？

356
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:41,960
Liru, what brings you here?
丽茹，妳怎么来了？

357
00:32:42,040 --> 00:32:43,000
Heading out?
要出去呀？

358
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:46,720
Is this a good time?
方便吗？

359
00:32:46,800 --> 00:32:48,800
If it's not, I'll come back later.
要是不方便的话，我就先回去了

360
00:32:48,880 --> 00:32:49,760
It's fine...
方便…

361
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:51,320
Come... come in.
妳进…进屋吧

362
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,200
What are you coming in for?
你进来干啥呀？

363
00:32:56,280 --> 00:32:57,640
We know each other, just gonna chat.
俺俩认识，唠唠嗑吧

364
00:32:57,720 --> 00:32:59,400
Chat about what? Get lost...
唠啥唠呀？ 走吧…

365
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:03,160
You people are really warm.
你们这人可真热情

366
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,280
Warm, my foot.
热情啥？

367
00:33:04,360 --> 00:33:05,520
Young workers.
青工

368
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:07,800
Didn't even finish middle school, no manners.
国中都没毕业呢，没啥素质

369
00:33:08,760 --> 00:33:09,680
Have a seat, Liru.
妳坐呀，丽茹

370
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,320
I keep telling them,
总跟他们强调

371
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:17,760
I say, mind the housekeeping...
我说注意内务…

372
00:33:17,840 --> 00:33:19,800
these few punks keep coming to wreck my place.
就这几个小子总跑我这搞破坏

373
00:33:19,880 --> 00:33:20,800
Sit.
坐

374
00:33:25,800 --> 00:33:26,840
All clean.
干净了

375
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,280
Let me pour... pour you some water.
我给妳倒…倒杯水喝

376
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:53,360
Okay.
好

377
00:33:56,080 --> 00:33:57,040
It's clean.
干净的

378
00:34:06,080 --> 00:34:07,000
Thanks.
谢谢

379
00:34:08,080 --> 00:34:09,600
-Too hot? I'll add some cold water.
-It's fine...
-是不烫呀？ 我给妳加点凉水
-没事…

380
00:34:09,680 --> 00:34:11,000
I brought a handkerchief.
我有带手绢

381
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:22,760
Did you come to see me about something?
妳找我有事啊？

382
00:34:25,720 --> 00:34:27,240
It's nothing really.
其实也没啥事

383
00:34:28,120 --> 00:34:29,720
It's just, these past few days,
就是我这几天嘛

384
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:32,120
I keep having dreams.
老爱作梦

385
00:34:32,200 --> 00:34:33,600
Dreams about what?
作啥梦啊？

386
00:34:38,240 --> 00:34:40,400
I forget where I read this line,
我忘了我在哪看到那么一句话

387
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:42,200
but it was quite philosophical.
说得挺有哲理的

388
00:34:42,680 --> 00:34:44,160
Roughly it means...
大概意思就是…

389
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:46,160
the person who appears in your dream,
梦里出现的人

390
00:34:46,720 --> 00:34:48,519
the moment you wake, you should go see them.
你醒过来马上就要去见他

391
00:34:48,999 --> 00:34:50,560
Life is that simple.
生活就是这么简单

392
00:34:52,479 --> 00:34:53,600
"The Lovers on the Bridge."
《新桥恋人》

393
00:34:53,680 --> 00:34:54,800
A French film.
法国片

394
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,439
You know so much.
你懂的可真多

395
00:34:59,720 --> 00:35:00,560
Oh, right.
对了

396
00:35:00,640 --> 00:35:04,200
That book about dreams you mentioned last time,
上回你说那本跟作梦有关的书

397
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:05,519
could I borrow it?
能借我看看吗？

398
00:35:07,519 --> 00:35:08,439
"The Interpretation of Dreams."
《梦的解析》

399
00:35:08,519 --> 00:35:10,240
By Freud, of Austria.
奥地利，佛洛伊德作

400
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:12,160
If you want it, I'll find it for you.
妳要，我找给妳

401
00:35:13,519 --> 00:35:14,959
If there's one thing I have, it's books.
我这就是书多

402
00:35:22,200 --> 00:35:23,680
-Is it hard to find?
-It's fine.
-好找吗？
-没事

403
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,320
If it's too much trouble, never mind.
要是太费劲就算了

404
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:27,240
It's fine...
没事…

405
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:29,520
I even flipped through a couple pages before bed last night.
我昨晚睡前我还…我还翻两页呢

406
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:37,800
My books are such a jumble.
我这书太杂了

407
00:35:45,240 --> 00:35:46,200
You okay?
没事吧？

408
00:35:46,280 --> 00:35:47,600
I'm fine...
没事…

409
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:49,840
Did you hurt yourself?
碰哪了？

410
00:35:51,040 --> 00:35:53,320
Here... come on, let me help you up, come.
来…你过来，扶你走，来

411
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:55,280
What's wrong?
怎么了？

412
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,440
Something's in my eye.
好像迷眼了

413
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:58,400
Sit still...
坐好…

414
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,400
Let me look.
我看看

415
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,520
Which eye?
哪只眼睛啊？

416
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:03,640
This one.
这个

417
00:36:08,640 --> 00:36:09,600
Any better?
好点没？

418
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,800
No, blow on it again.
没好，妳再吹一吹

419
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:22,960
Now?
这回呢？

420
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,240
What is it?
怎么的了？

421
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:31,840
You smell so nice.
妳身上味真好闻

422
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:34,720
Smell like what?
啥味啊？

423
00:36:35,520 --> 00:36:36,920
Like disinfectant.
消毒水味

424
00:37:11,200 --> 00:37:12,800
What the heck?
什么玩意呢？

425
00:37:32,240 --> 00:37:34,520
Hello, could you find Gong Biao for me?
你好，你帮我找一下龚彪

426
00:37:35,160 --> 00:37:37,080
Room two-two-two, from the plant office.
三个二，厂办的

427
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:48,520
There you are.
在这呢

428
00:37:48,600 --> 00:37:49,920
No wonder I couldn't find you.
我说怎么找不着呢

429
00:37:50,680 --> 00:37:51,880
Biaozi.
彪子

430
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,160
You love studying too much.
你太爱学习了

431
00:37:54,400 --> 00:37:55,360
It's a habit.
习惯了

432
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:56,760
Arming yourself with knowledge.
用知识武装自己

433
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:01,920
Wait, we haven't even made things official yet.
不是，咱俩还没确定关系

434
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:03,080
Isn't this improper?
这样不合适吧？

435
00:38:03,160 --> 00:38:04,120
Let me ask you,
我问你

436
00:38:04,720 --> 00:38:05,840
do you love me?
你爱我吗？

437
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:06,880
I do.
我爱

438
00:38:06,960 --> 00:38:08,040
If you love me, it's proper.
爱我就合适

439
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:15,120
Biaozi, there's a call for you at the front desk.
彪子，传达室有你电话来

440
00:38:19,960 --> 00:38:21,320
Tell them I'm not here.
你说我不在

441
00:38:24,360 --> 00:38:26,040
He didn't say where he went?
他没说上哪去啊？

442
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:29,440
Didn't leave any message before he left?
临走也没留个话啥的？

443
00:38:31,600 --> 00:38:32,840
Okay, thanks.
好，谢谢

444
00:38:44,080 --> 00:38:45,280
Unreliable.
不着调

445
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:11,640
Stop.
站住

446
00:40:13,240 --> 00:40:14,240
Stop.
站住

447
00:40:15,560 --> 00:40:16,680
Don't move.
别动啊

448
00:40:18,840 --> 00:40:20,480
I've got a weapon for self-defense here.
我手里可带着防身工具呢

449
00:40:22,720 --> 00:40:23,840
Where's Wang Yang?
王阳呢？

450
00:40:26,240 --> 00:40:27,880
I know you're in this together.
我知道你们是一伙的

451
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:32,840
The police are coming any minute.
警察马上就来了

452
00:40:35,680 --> 00:40:36,920
When the police get here,
等警察来了

453
00:40:38,400 --> 00:40:39,840
your attitude will change.
就不是这个态度了

454
00:40:53,040 --> 00:40:54,040
Turn around.
转过来

455
00:40:56,280 --> 00:40:57,600
Tie yourself up.
把自己捆上

456
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:04,600
Stop.
站住

457
00:41:45,640 --> 00:41:47,080
Can you please...
你们能不能…

458
00:41:48,240 --> 00:41:49,520
let Wang Yang go?
放过王阳？

459
00:41:51,960 --> 00:41:53,400
What do you want?
你们想要啥？

460
00:41:55,040 --> 00:41:56,240
As long as you let Wang Yang go,
只要放过王阳

461
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:58,960
I... I'll agree to anything.
我…我什么都能答应

462
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:03,280
Don't worry.
你放心

463
00:42:05,120 --> 00:42:06,360
I'll keep my mouth shut.
我嘴肯定严

464
00:42:08,240 --> 00:42:09,720
As long as you let Wang Yang...
只要把王阳…

465
00:42:10,640 --> 00:42:13,120
go, I... I won't say a word.
放了，我…我什么都不会说

466
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:17,480
I'm begging you.
我求你了

467
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:21,680
He's our only precious son.
我们就这么一个宝贝儿子

468
00:42:26,560 --> 00:42:28,640
His mother's worried sick at home.
他妈在家都急死了

469
00:42:29,160 --> 00:42:30,880
His mother has a heart condition.
他妈有心脏病

470
00:42:31,640 --> 00:42:33,040
She can't take the shock.
受不了刺激

471
00:42:33,560 --> 00:42:35,200
Besides, I promised her
另外，我答应她

472
00:42:35,280 --> 00:42:37,120
I'd bring Wang Yang home today.
今天带王阳回去

473
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:40,120
I'm begging you.
我求你了

474
00:43:04,480 --> 00:43:05,640
I'm sorry.
对不起

475
00:43:10,240 --> 00:43:12,080
Wang Yang is all I have.
我只有王阳了

476
00:43:19,760 --> 00:43:21,200
I'm sorry.
对不起

477
00:43:23,160 --> 00:43:24,400
I'm sorry.
对不起

478
00:44:14,840 --> 00:44:16,080
It's okay.
没事啊

479
00:44:16,160 --> 00:44:17,520
Where have you been all these days?
你们这些天去哪了？

480
00:44:17,600 --> 00:44:19,200
I thought something had happened to you.
我以为妳出事了呢

481
00:44:21,720 --> 00:44:23,320
Why are you alone?
怎么就妳自己呀？

482
00:44:23,400 --> 00:44:24,320
Where's Weijun?
军儿呢？

483
00:44:29,200 --> 00:44:31,200
He got caught.
他被抓了

484
00:44:39,400 --> 00:44:40,920
Come back with me.
妳跟我回去吧

485
00:44:45,160 --> 00:44:46,360
What did you say?
你说什么？

486
00:44:48,440 --> 00:44:49,680
I've made up my mind.
我想好了

487
00:44:50,600 --> 00:44:51,880
Let's go back.
咱们回去吧

488
00:44:52,760 --> 00:44:53,720
I'll turn myself in.
我去自首

489
00:44:54,200 --> 00:44:55,400
Why?
为什么？

490
00:44:56,720 --> 00:44:59,040
Didn't we agree to leave together?
咱们不是说好一起走的吗？

491
00:44:59,120 --> 00:45:01,560
You can't spend your whole life a fugitive.
妳不能一辈子当逃犯呀

492
00:45:02,200 --> 00:45:04,320
If you go back now, you still have a chance.
现在回去妳还有机会

493
00:45:08,240 --> 00:45:10,120
It's too late, Wang Yang.
来不及了，王阳

494
00:45:11,120 --> 00:45:12,880
I can't go back.
我回不去了

495
00:45:12,960 --> 00:45:14,040
It's not too late.
来得及

496
00:45:14,520 --> 00:45:16,640
We'll say the Lu Wenzhong thing was all me.
就说卢文仲的事都是我干的

497
00:45:18,720 --> 00:45:20,200
I killed him.
人是我杀的

498
00:45:20,840 --> 00:45:22,760
I disposed of the body too.
尸体也是我处理的

499
00:45:22,840 --> 00:45:24,000
It has nothing to do with you.
跟妳没关系

500
00:45:25,720 --> 00:45:27,520
You can still go on with school.
妳还能继续上学

501
00:45:28,200 --> 00:45:29,640
Still play piano.
还能弹钢琴

502
00:45:29,720 --> 00:45:31,080
Still become a doctor.
还能当医生

503
00:45:34,520 --> 00:45:36,480
If I somehow make it out alive,
要是我还能活着的话

504
00:45:38,400 --> 00:45:39,920
wait for me.
妳就等着我

505
00:45:45,880 --> 00:45:47,400
I killed Yin Hong.
我杀了殷红

506
00:45:53,520 --> 00:45:55,680
The "me" they think they know
他们以为的我

507
00:45:56,920 --> 00:45:58,160
is Yin Hong.
是殷红

508
00:46:03,360 --> 00:46:05,160
I killed Yin Hong.
殷红是我杀的

509
00:46:13,840 --> 00:46:15,880
Wang Yang, you're all I have.
王阳，我只有你了

510
00:46:20,120 --> 00:46:21,880
Didn't we agree
我们不是说好

511
00:46:23,640 --> 00:46:25,880
to find a new place together,
一起找一个新的地方

512
00:46:27,400 --> 00:46:29,200
and live all over again?
重新活一次吗？

513
00:46:32,200 --> 00:46:33,880
Wang Yang, you're all I have.
王阳，我只有你了

514
00:46:33,960 --> 00:46:35,640
Come away with me.
你跟我一起走吧

515
00:47:13,240 --> 00:47:14,520
I understand now.
我明白了

516
00:47:18,600 --> 00:47:20,760
You and I aren't the same after all.
你和我还是不一样

517
00:47:23,640 --> 00:47:25,200
You have your home.
你有你的家

518
00:47:27,400 --> 00:47:28,920
You have your parents.
你有你爸妈

519
00:47:32,000 --> 00:47:33,760
I have nothing left.
我什么都没有了

520
00:48:43,360 --> 00:48:44,200
Master Wang.
王师傅

521
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:49,200
Sorry about that, Master Wang.
对不住啊，王师傅

522
00:48:49,280 --> 00:48:51,200
Something came up last minute and held me up.
我临时有点事，绊住脚了

523
00:48:51,280 --> 00:48:52,240
Your wife said you weren't home.
嫂子说你不在家

524
00:48:52,320 --> 00:48:53,880
So I came out to meet you.
我想着出来迎迎你

525
00:48:54,440 --> 00:48:55,360
Want me to take over your shift?
要倒班不？

526
00:48:55,440 --> 00:48:56,840
I'll... I'll keep watch a while.
我…我盯一会去

527
00:49:01,840 --> 00:49:03,440
How'd you get so filthy?
你怎么整得脏兮兮的？

528
00:49:04,320 --> 00:49:05,520
What happened?
怎么整的？

529
00:49:06,720 --> 00:49:07,720
It's nothing.
没事

530
00:49:08,800 --> 00:49:10,120
Got myself caught on something.
自己卡的

531
00:49:15,000 --> 00:49:16,080
Biaozi.
彪子

532
00:49:17,400 --> 00:49:18,440
I need a favor.
求你个事

533
00:49:18,920 --> 00:49:21,080
Between us, no need to ask.
咱俩之间啥求不求的？

534
00:49:21,160 --> 00:49:22,360
What is it?
啥事啊？

535
00:49:23,240 --> 00:49:25,200
It's about this business with our Wang Yang.
就是我们家王阳那事

536
00:49:26,680 --> 00:49:28,520
Don't tell anyone, all right?
和谁都别说，好不好？

537
00:49:28,600 --> 00:49:30,920
Don't worry, my lips are sealed.
你放心，我嘴肯定严实

538
00:49:31,000 --> 00:49:31,920
Where's Wang Yang?
王阳呢？

539
00:49:34,200 --> 00:49:35,920
Don't ask. Go on home.
别问了，回去吧

540
00:50:09,880 --> 00:50:10,960
Where's Yang'er?
阳儿呢？

541
00:50:13,680 --> 00:50:14,760
Where's my boy?
孩子呢？

542
00:50:16,880 --> 00:50:18,160
No, say something.
不，你说话呀

543
00:50:18,240 --> 00:50:19,720
Where did the boy go?
孩子哪去了？

544
00:50:25,440 --> 00:50:26,600
Yang'er ran off.
阳儿跑了

545
00:50:31,480 --> 00:50:32,640
Did you run into him?
你碰上他了？

546
00:50:34,360 --> 00:50:35,840
I didn't run into Yang'er.
我没碰着阳儿

547
00:50:37,600 --> 00:50:39,800
The one I ran into was probably his accomplice.
我碰见的可能是他的同伙

548
00:50:39,880 --> 00:50:42,000
No, how... how could you let him get away?
不是，怎么…怎么能让他跑了呢？

549
00:50:42,080 --> 00:50:43,160
You said you'd surely bring him...
你不说你肯定能把他…

550
00:50:43,240 --> 00:50:45,720
Stop wailing at me, my head hurts.
妳别给我嗷嗷了，我脑袋疼

551
00:50:50,760 --> 00:50:52,680
No, he can't have run.
不是，他不能跑

552
00:50:52,760 --> 00:50:55,000
He told me to wait for him at home.
他跟我说他让我在家等他

553
00:50:57,880 --> 00:50:58,800
Oh God.
妈呀

554
00:51:02,880 --> 00:51:04,720
Where could that boy have gone?
这孩子能跑哪去呀？

555
00:51:14,280 --> 00:51:15,520
Where'd he run to?
他跑哪？

556
00:51:17,520 --> 00:51:18,440
Here.
来

557
00:51:18,960 --> 00:51:19,880
Here... take your medicine.
来…吃药

558
00:51:21,000 --> 00:51:22,080
Take your medicine.
吃药

559
00:51:22,160 --> 00:51:23,920
Take it... here.
吃药…来

560
00:51:28,040 --> 00:51:29,400
Don't overthink it.
妳别多想啊

561
00:51:30,800 --> 00:51:31,800
Yang'er's surely fine.
阳儿肯定没事

562
00:51:32,600 --> 00:51:35,000
No, I'm going out to look for him again.
不行，我一会我出去再找他

563
00:51:35,080 --> 00:51:36,240
Take your medicine.
把药吃了

564
00:51:43,520 --> 00:51:44,760
Promise me.
你答应我

565
00:51:46,560 --> 00:51:48,680
Bring my son back to me.
你把儿子给我领回来

566
00:51:51,280 --> 00:51:52,720
Don't worry.
妳放心

567
00:51:53,320 --> 00:51:55,120
Our son's sharp.
咱儿子精明

568
00:51:55,680 --> 00:51:57,120
Wherever he ends up, once he's settled,
他走到哪，落脚之后

569
00:51:57,200 --> 00:51:58,800
he'll surely contact us.
肯定会联系我们

570
00:51:59,280 --> 00:52:01,440
Then we'll go bring him home together.
到时候我们一起把他接回来

571
00:52:01,520 --> 00:52:03,240
Here, take your medicine.
来，把药吃了

572
00:52:25,840 --> 00:52:27,880
Lie down a while, rest and calm down.
妳得躺会，躺会静一静

573
00:52:35,160 --> 00:52:36,280
What are you doing?
妳干啥呀？

574
00:52:37,320 --> 00:52:39,160
I'm reheating the food.
我把菜热热

575
00:52:39,240 --> 00:52:41,320
When the boy comes back, he'll be eating cold food.
一会孩子回来，吃凉饭了

576
00:52:58,720 --> 00:52:59,760
(Hualin Steel)
（桦林钢铁）

577
00:52:59,840 --> 00:53:02,600
(Hualin Steel No. 1 Main Plant Workers' Congress)
（桦林钢铁第一总厂职工代表大会）

578
00:53:17,600 --> 00:53:19,440
Why polish it so bright?
擦那么亮干啥呀？

579
00:53:19,520 --> 00:53:21,080
The trains don't even run anymore.
火车也不跑了

580
00:53:22,560 --> 00:53:24,480
People are at fault, not the engine.
人有错，它没错

581
00:53:25,240 --> 00:53:26,360
When I see it all grimy,
我看它脏兮兮的

582
00:53:26,440 --> 00:53:27,680
it pains my heart.
我心里难受

583
00:53:29,560 --> 00:53:31,120
Quanli's not coming either.
这全力也不来了

584
00:53:31,600 --> 00:53:33,760
Hauling loads for someone, he crushed his leg.
帮人拉活，把腿给砸坏了

585
00:53:34,800 --> 00:53:36,320
All for his wife and kids.
那都是为了老婆、孩子

586
00:53:37,800 --> 00:53:39,480
This time when they announce the layoff list,
这回宣布下岗名单

587
00:53:39,560 --> 00:53:41,120
I'll be first on it in the locomotive depot.
机务段我排头一个

588
00:53:41,200 --> 00:53:42,440
It won't be you.
轮不上你

589
00:53:43,520 --> 00:53:45,520
I'll definitely be ahead of you.
我肯定排在你前头

590
00:53:49,240 --> 00:53:50,800
Let's go, Master Wang.
走吧，王师傅

591
00:53:50,880 --> 00:53:52,360
The music's already playing.
歌都放起来了

592
00:53:53,080 --> 00:53:54,200
You go ahead.
你先过去

593
00:53:54,760 --> 00:53:56,280
I'll come once I've finished polishing.
我擦完了就过去

594
00:53:57,440 --> 00:53:58,840
Not going to hear the list?
不听名单了？

595
00:54:00,560 --> 00:54:02,160
It was decided long ago.
早就定好的事了

596
00:54:02,760 --> 00:54:04,440
What difference does hearing it make?
听不听有啥两样的？

597
00:54:07,360 --> 00:54:08,800
I'll go listen.
我听听吧

598
00:54:29,760 --> 00:54:30,800
Biaozi.
彪子

599
00:54:32,160 --> 00:54:33,400
Don't go shouting.
你别瞎喊

600
00:54:34,120 --> 00:54:35,240
What've you got in your hand?
手里拿的啥呀？

601
00:54:35,880 --> 00:54:36,720
The layoff list?
下岗名单啊？

602
00:54:36,800 --> 00:54:37,680
Let me have a peek.
我瞅一眼

603
00:54:37,760 --> 00:54:39,720
No, can I just let you peek at a confidential document?
不，机密文件能随便让你们瞅吗？

604
00:54:40,440 --> 00:54:42,480
From now on, stop yelling "Biaozi, Biaozi" in public.
以后在外面别老喊彪子彪子啊

605
00:54:42,560 --> 00:54:44,040
-Show some respect.
-Fine.
-注意点分寸
-行

606
00:54:44,120 --> 00:54:45,440
After the meeting, he's getting promoted.
一会开会人提拔了

607
00:54:45,520 --> 00:54:46,640
Sure, Director Biao.
行，彪主任

608
00:54:46,720 --> 00:54:48,080
Don't talk nonsense.
别瞎说

609
00:54:48,640 --> 00:54:51,400
Until the official red-header order comes down, it's not official, got it?
红头文件没下来都不算数，知道不？

610
00:54:52,280 --> 00:54:54,680
In a few days I'll set something up at Canteen No. 2.
过几天我在二食堂安排

611
00:54:54,760 --> 00:54:55,880
Everyone come, all right?
到时候大伙都到啊

612
00:54:55,960 --> 00:54:57,080
Set up what?
安排啥呀？

613
00:54:57,680 --> 00:54:58,960
A wedding banquet.
喜酒吧

614
00:54:59,040 --> 00:55:00,560
Liru and I are about to register our marriage.
我跟丽茹马上要领证了

615
00:55:00,640 --> 00:55:01,680
Huang Liru?
黄丽茹？

616
00:55:01,760 --> 00:55:02,840
The one from the plant hospital?
厂医院那个？

617
00:55:03,440 --> 00:55:04,760
Who else would it be?
那还能有谁呀？

618
00:55:04,840 --> 00:55:06,480
Would I settle for just anyone?
一般人我能看上吗？

619
00:55:06,560 --> 00:55:08,720
That scarf of yours is pretty snazzy.
你这围脖整得挺带劲啊

620
00:55:09,200 --> 00:55:10,040
Liru bought it.
丽茹买的

621
00:55:10,120 --> 00:55:11,640
It's part of a set, see?
这不一套的吗？

622
00:55:11,720 --> 00:55:13,120
Nice color.
色挺正

623
00:55:13,200 --> 00:55:14,720
Little Gong, what are you chatting about over there?
小龚，唠啥呢在那？

624
00:55:14,800 --> 00:55:15,800
Get moving.
赶紧的

625
00:55:18,760 --> 00:55:20,160
Biaozi's taking the fall.
彪子接锅了

626
00:55:20,240 --> 00:55:21,160
What do you mean?
啥意思？

627
00:55:21,240 --> 00:55:22,200
Let me tell you,
我告诉你啊

628
00:55:22,280 --> 00:55:26,240
Song Yukun's wife went to the plant hospital this morning and made a scene.
宋玉坤他媳妇早上去厂医院闹去了

629
00:55:26,320 --> 00:55:29,280
Said Huang Liru seduced the factory director.
说黄丽茹勾引厂长

630
00:55:30,560 --> 00:55:31,560
-For real?
-For real.
-真的假的？
-真的

631
00:55:31,640 --> 00:55:33,600
The two of them have been at it a long time.
他俩都好老长时间了

632
00:55:33,680 --> 00:55:34,680
Listen, you two,
我告诉你俩啊

633
00:55:34,760 --> 00:55:36,880
keep it to yourselves, don't spread it around.
自己知道得了，别出去说去

634
00:55:36,960 --> 00:55:38,040
Okay... got it.
行…知道了

635
00:55:38,120 --> 00:55:39,000
Give me a light.
火给我

636
00:56:05,560 --> 00:56:07,440
What are you doing over here? Done pouring the water?
你跑这来干啥呢？ 水倒完了吗？

637
00:56:07,520 --> 00:56:08,360
Done.
倒完了

638
00:56:08,440 --> 00:56:10,080
I figured I'd ask if there's anything else to do.
我寻思问问还有没有别的活

639
00:56:10,640 --> 00:56:13,240
Um... arrange the flowers on the stage nicely,
那啥…你把台上那花再好好摆摆

640
00:56:13,320 --> 00:56:15,160
and once that's done, go over the meeting agenda with them again.
摆完之后把会议流程 再跟他们对一下

641
00:56:15,240 --> 00:56:16,240
-Go on.
-Okay.
-去吧
-行

642
00:56:38,000 --> 00:56:39,240
There's nothing more to say.
没啥好说的

643
00:56:40,360 --> 00:56:41,880
I've thought it all through.
我都想明白了

644
00:56:43,000 --> 00:56:44,840
I definitely can't keep this child.
这孩子我肯定不能要

645
00:56:44,920 --> 00:56:46,240
Let's not be rash, okay?
咱别冲动好不好？

646
00:56:46,320 --> 00:56:47,640
Just give me a little time.
妳稍微给我点时间

647
00:56:47,720 --> 00:56:49,040
I'm not being rash.
我没冲动

648
00:56:49,120 --> 00:56:50,120
I'm getting married.
我要结婚了

649
00:56:50,200 --> 00:56:51,600
Let's end it here.
咱们到此为止吧

650
00:56:52,080 --> 00:56:53,000
Let's not see each other anymore.
以后别见面了

651
00:56:53,080 --> 00:56:53,960
Liru.
丽茹

652
00:56:54,720 --> 00:56:55,600
Liru.
丽茹

653
00:57:17,560 --> 00:57:19,240
(Hualin Steel No. 1 Main Plant Workers' Congress)
（桦林钢铁第一总厂职工代表大会）

654
00:57:19,320 --> 00:57:21,040
Workers of Hualin Steel,
桦钢的职工们

655
00:57:21,120 --> 00:57:23,440
today fate brings us together here.
今天我们有缘相聚在这

656
00:57:23,520 --> 00:57:25,960
My feelings are very complicated.
我这个心里很复杂

657
00:57:26,440 --> 00:57:28,680
I have deep feelings for Hualin Steel.
我对桦钢有很深的感情

658
00:57:28,760 --> 00:57:32,320
I believe everyone here feels the same about Hualin Steel as I do.
我相信在座的各位 对桦钢的情感跟我是一样的

659
00:57:32,400 --> 00:57:34,560
Some comrades feel even more deeply than I.
甚至有些同志比我还要深

660
00:57:36,120 --> 00:57:39,320
But today there's a fact I must share with you all.
但今天有个事实我不得不跟大伙说

661
00:57:39,800 --> 00:57:43,120
Hualin Steel's situation right now is not optimistic.
就是桦钢现在的处境不乐观

662
00:57:43,200 --> 00:57:44,920
-The burden is very heavy.
-Master Wang.
-负担非常重
-王师傅

663
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:46,880
This carriage that is Hualin Steel —
桦钢这驾马车

664
00:57:48,240 --> 00:57:49,120
it can't be pulled any longer.
拉不动了

665
00:57:49,720 --> 00:57:50,840
Where's he up to?
讲到哪了？

666
00:57:50,920 --> 00:57:52,280
Just started.
刚开始

667
00:57:52,360 --> 00:57:53,880
Rambling on about a load of useless stuff.
净扯一堆没有用的

668
00:57:54,360 --> 00:57:56,000
We came just to hear the list, didn't we?
来不就是听名单的吗？

669
00:57:57,680 --> 00:58:00,560
Don't they have to sound the opening gong before the opera?
唱戏之前不得有个开场锣吗？

670
00:58:01,080 --> 00:58:03,040
We know their routine all too well.
他们这套路子咱太熟了

671
00:58:03,520 --> 00:58:06,280
Now is the time for us to give back to Hualin Steel.
现在就是我们回馈桦钢的时候

672
00:58:13,720 --> 00:58:16,640
Some comrades have grievances, and I understand that.
有一些同志有怨言，我可以理解

673
00:58:17,800 --> 00:58:20,040
But once grievances turn into rumors,
但怨言一旦变成谣言

674
00:58:20,120 --> 00:58:21,560
that's fatal.
那是致命的

675
00:58:25,960 --> 00:58:26,960
What are you standing there for?
愣着干啥呀？

676
00:58:27,040 --> 00:58:27,960
Go pour the water.
倒水去

677
00:58:29,760 --> 00:58:31,600
What else I want to say is, some workers —
还有我要说的就是一些职工

678
00:58:32,160 --> 00:58:33,160
for instance, dual-worker households —
比如说双职工

679
00:58:33,240 --> 00:58:34,560
who are genuinely in difficulty,
确实遇到困难的

680
00:58:34,640 --> 00:58:36,400
we must help them in good time.
我们要及时地予以帮助

681
00:58:36,480 --> 00:58:39,520
We must also tackle the issue of raising output and efficiency.
还有就是要解决增产、增效这个问题

682
00:58:39,600 --> 00:58:41,840
That's the focus of our work going forward.
这是我们接下来工作的重点

683
00:58:41,920 --> 00:58:44,400
Win or lose, live life boldly.
看成败，人生豪迈

684
00:58:44,480 --> 00:58:47,160
We must have confidence and resolve.
我们必须要有信心，要有决心

685
00:58:47,240 --> 00:58:49,440
There's no hurdle we can't clear.
没有什么坎是我们过不去的

686
00:58:50,120 --> 00:58:51,240
Enough.
够了

687
00:58:51,920 --> 00:58:53,280
What are you doing?
你干啥呢？

688
00:58:56,880 --> 00:58:58,560
Why'd the mic cut out?
怎么还哑火了呢？

689
00:58:59,360 --> 00:59:00,960
What exactly is between you and Liru?
你到底跟丽茹啥关系？

690
00:59:02,520 --> 00:59:03,880
I'm giving a report. Get down.
我在作报告，下去

691
00:59:03,960 --> 00:59:04,920
You fucking set me up.
你他妈坑我

692
00:59:05,600 --> 00:59:07,360
Gong Biao, don't push your luck. Get down.
龚彪，别给脸不要，下去

693
00:59:07,440 --> 00:59:09,040
Gong Biao, get down.
龚彪，你下来

694
00:59:09,120 --> 00:59:10,000
Get down, now.
你快下来你

695
00:59:10,080 --> 00:59:11,400
Something's off.
不对劲

696
00:59:13,600 --> 00:59:15,880
-Security comrades!
-Fuck you, Song Yukun.
-保卫科的同志
-操你妈的，宋玉坤

697
00:59:15,960 --> 00:59:17,400
-You trying to start a riot?
-Stop it, now.
-你要造反吗你？
-快住手

698
00:59:17,480 --> 00:59:19,160
-Say it, come on.
-What are you doing? Rioting?
-你说呀你
-干什么你？ 你要造反吗你？

699
00:59:19,240 --> 00:59:20,320
Jianchun.
建春

700
00:59:20,400 --> 00:59:21,400
-Somebody!
-Biaozi.
-来人
-彪子

701
00:59:21,480 --> 00:59:23,760
-Biaozi...
-Let go, today I'll...
-彪子…
-撒开，我今天我…

702
00:59:23,840 --> 00:59:25,720
-Get him... what are you doing?
-Biaozi.
-给我…干什么？
-彪子

703
00:59:26,520 --> 00:59:28,240
Have you fucking lost your mind?
你他妈吃错药了你呀？

704
00:59:28,320 --> 00:59:29,480
What do you think you're doing?
你这要干什么？

705
00:59:29,960 --> 00:59:31,200
Outrageous.
太猖狂了

706
00:59:36,080 --> 00:59:37,400
You all right, Director?
没事吧，厂长？

707
00:59:42,840 --> 00:59:44,280
-What are you doing?
-Put your back into it.
-干什么？
-使点劲

708
00:59:44,360 --> 00:59:45,360
-Hit him.
-Hit him.
-揍他
-揍他

709
00:59:45,440 --> 00:59:48,200
-Beat a man to death and you won't pay?
-Harder.
-你们打死人不偿命
-使点劲

710
00:59:49,040 --> 00:59:50,920
I... Jianchun...
我…建春…

711
00:59:51,000 --> 00:59:53,080
That's about enough with the work matters.
工作上的事你差不多行了

712
00:59:54,000 --> 00:59:56,200
Who are you to say? Fine, your call.
你是干啥的？ 听你的

713
00:59:56,280 --> 00:59:57,160
Wait.
不是

714
00:59:57,240 --> 00:59:58,480
If you beat him badly,
你打坏了

715
00:59:58,560 --> 01:00:00,080
won't you be held responsible?
你不得担责任啊？

716
01:00:02,200 --> 01:00:04,280
Wang Xiang, I'm doing this for your sake.
王响，我看你面子

717
01:00:04,360 --> 01:00:05,760
Only for you.
也就是你

718
01:00:05,840 --> 01:00:07,440
Anyone else today, and it wouldn't have worked.
今天换另外一个人都不管用的

719
01:00:07,520 --> 01:00:09,160
All right... that's enough.
好…行了

720
01:00:09,240 --> 01:00:10,160
Jianchun.
建春

721
01:00:11,200 --> 01:00:12,040
Okay.
行

722
01:00:12,120 --> 01:00:13,320
You two keep an eye on him.
你俩盯着点

723
01:00:13,960 --> 01:00:15,240
The meeting's not over.
会没开完

724
01:00:15,320 --> 01:00:16,760
Don't let him back in, you hear?
不能让他进去，听着没有？

725
01:00:16,840 --> 01:00:17,760
Get to it.
赶紧的

726
01:00:22,840 --> 01:00:24,000
I'm giving you face, let me tell you.
我给你面子，我告诉你

727
01:00:40,240 --> 01:00:44,160
Just now some comrades got rather worked up.
刚才有些同志的情绪比较激动

728
01:00:45,080 --> 01:00:46,600
That's understandable.
这个可以理解

729
01:00:47,120 --> 01:00:49,760
After all, our plant now faces a difficult historic choice.
毕竟咱们厂现在面临着 艰难的历史抉择

730
01:01:07,200 --> 01:01:08,440
Talk to me.
你跟我说说

731
01:01:09,120 --> 01:01:10,480
What's it really about?
到底因为啥？

732
01:01:17,160 --> 01:01:21,080
I see everyone's quite concerned about the layoff and furlough list, yes?
我看大家对下岗、待岗人员名单 都比较关心，是吧？

733
01:01:21,160 --> 01:01:23,720
So I'll adjust the agenda on the spot.
那我就临时改改会议进程

734
01:01:25,880 --> 01:01:28,440
I'll announce the layoff and furlough list early.
提前宣布下岗、待岗人员名单

735
01:01:31,200 --> 01:01:32,800
Speaking of layoffs and furloughs,
说到下岗、待岗

736
01:01:32,880 --> 01:01:34,640
the plant office will lead the way.
我们厂办带个头

737
01:01:35,920 --> 01:01:37,880
Plant office layoff:
厂办下岗人员

738
01:01:39,920 --> 01:01:41,080
Gong Biao.
龚彪

739
01:01:48,040 --> 01:01:49,360
Locomotive depot layoffs:
机务段下岗人员

740
01:01:49,440 --> 01:01:50,640
Zhang Youcheng.
张有成

741
01:01:51,840 --> 01:01:52,880
Hao Chenggang.
郝成钢

742
01:01:52,960 --> 01:01:54,400
This suit's no big deal anyway.
这身衣服也没啥大不了的

743
01:01:54,480 --> 01:01:55,560
Li Qing.
李庆

744
01:01:57,480 --> 01:01:58,480
Fang Zhonghua.
方中华

745
01:01:59,800 --> 01:02:01,600
Equipment section layoffs:
设备科下岗人员

746
01:02:03,160 --> 01:02:04,440
Sun Liqiang.
孙立强

747
01:02:06,600 --> 01:02:07,720
Tian Mingzhi.
田明智

748
01:02:08,640 --> 01:02:10,200
What's going on, Master Wang?
怎么回事呀，王师傅？

749
01:02:10,280 --> 01:02:11,920
Jiang Yanquan.
蒋彦全

750
01:02:17,640 --> 01:02:19,160
Comrade Wang Xiang, is there something?
王响同志，有事吗？

751
01:02:21,960 --> 01:02:24,320
You're a real fucking piece of garbage.
你他妈真是个杂碎

752
01:02:30,440 --> 01:02:32,120
-Seen Biaozi?
-He was on stage just now.
-看见彪子了吗？
-刚才还在台上呢

753
01:02:32,680 --> 01:02:33,960
What did you say?
你说啥？

754
01:02:34,960 --> 01:02:35,800
Garbage.
杂碎

755
01:02:36,440 --> 01:02:37,600
From the locomotive depot.
机务段的

756
01:02:43,160 --> 01:02:44,360
Pull them apart...
拉开…

757
01:02:45,720 --> 01:02:46,560
Stop fighting.
别打了

758
01:02:59,440 --> 01:03:01,280
A bunch of fucking useless idiots.
他妈一群废物

759
01:03:01,840 --> 01:03:03,760
What's your security section even good for?
你们保卫科干什么吃的你？

760
01:03:04,240 --> 01:03:05,920
Can't even hold back a few workers.
几个工人都拦不住

761
01:03:06,400 --> 01:03:08,200
Director, don't worry.
厂长，您放心

762
01:03:08,280 --> 01:03:10,440
Anyone who went up on that stage won't get away.
只要是上台的，谁都别想跑

763
01:03:10,520 --> 01:03:11,880
-We'll deal with them one by one.
-Right.
-挨个收拾他
-对

764
01:03:11,960 --> 01:03:13,720
Handle it firmly, make an example.
严肃处理，举一反三

765
01:03:13,800 --> 01:03:14,720
Deal with it firmly.
给我严肃处理

766
01:03:14,800 --> 01:03:15,680
It must be dealt with firmly.
必须严肃处理

767
01:03:15,760 --> 01:03:17,320
Especially that ringleader, Wang Xiang.
尤其是那个带头的王响

768
01:03:17,400 --> 01:03:18,480
I'll deal with him first.
我第一个就收拾他

769
01:03:19,160 --> 01:03:20,120
Calm down.
消消气

770
01:03:31,880 --> 01:03:33,840
Director, is it out of order?
厂长，不走字了？

771
01:03:33,920 --> 01:03:35,360
Get lost.
滚一边去

772
01:03:35,440 --> 01:03:36,640
Who are you two? Who are you looking for?
你俩干啥的？ 找谁呀？

773
01:03:36,720 --> 01:03:37,800
Is Song Yukun in?
宋玉坤在吧？

774
01:03:37,880 --> 01:03:39,800
Look, the director's busy, out you go...
不是，厂长挺忙的，出去…

775
01:03:40,280 --> 01:03:42,520
I'm talking to you two, hear me?
我跟你俩说话呢，听见没有？

776
01:03:44,040 --> 01:03:44,880
Song Yukun, right?
宋玉坤吧？

777
01:03:44,960 --> 01:03:46,840
Hey, just who are you?
不是，你是干啥的你是？

778
01:03:46,920 --> 01:03:48,400
We're from the Municipal Discipline Commission.
我们是市纪委的

779
01:03:49,480 --> 01:03:51,520
You've been reported for embezzling state assets,
有人举报你侵吞国有资产

780
01:03:51,600 --> 01:03:54,000
and for retaliating against workers under the guise of layoffs.
以下岗的名义打击报复工人

781
01:03:54,080 --> 01:03:55,600
Please cooperate with our investigation.
请你配合我们调查

782
01:04:18,880 --> 01:04:20,560
Quick to respond.
出警挺快

783
01:04:22,120 --> 01:04:23,480
Detaining me, are you?
要拘我呀？

784
01:04:24,760 --> 01:04:25,760
Let's go.
来吧

785
01:04:30,800 --> 01:04:31,760
Wang Yang.
王阳

786
01:04:34,760 --> 01:04:35,920
Found him.
找着了

787
01:04:47,320 --> 01:04:48,280
What are you doing? You can't go in.
你干啥？ 这不让进

788
01:04:48,360 --> 01:04:49,440
-I'm going in.
-Comrade, please cooperate.
-我进去
-同志，你配合一下

789
01:04:49,520 --> 01:04:50,640
Let him in.
让他进去

790
01:04:50,720 --> 01:04:51,640
Captain Ma.
马队

791
01:05:03,040 --> 01:05:04,040
Cui.
崔

792
01:05:07,400 --> 01:05:08,320
Is it Wang Yang?
是王阳吗？

793
01:05:11,520 --> 01:05:12,640
There's been a mistake, right?
整错了吧？

794
01:05:17,800 --> 01:05:19,200
It's a mistake, isn't it?
是不是整错了？

795
01:05:30,720 --> 01:05:31,720
Fang He.
方赫

796
01:05:45,760 --> 01:05:46,720
Get up.
起来

797
01:05:48,320 --> 01:05:49,760
What are you doing lying here?
在这躺着干啥？

798
01:05:51,400 --> 01:05:53,040
If you want to sleep, go home and sleep.
乐意睡，回家睡去

799
01:05:56,120 --> 01:05:57,120
Get up.
起来

800
01:06:00,040 --> 01:06:01,080
Be good.
听话

801
01:06:20,920 --> 01:06:21,880
Yang'er.
阳儿

802
01:06:24,920 --> 01:06:26,080
Yang'er.
阳儿

803
01:06:26,640 --> 01:06:28,360
Yang'er, don't scare your dad.
阳儿，你别吓唬爸

804
01:06:30,640 --> 01:06:31,560
Yang'er.
阳儿

805
01:06:33,160 --> 01:06:34,600
Yang'er, get up.
阳儿，你起来

806
01:06:34,680 --> 01:06:36,040
Get up, let's go home.
你起来回家

807
01:06:38,840 --> 01:06:40,800
Yang'er, get up.
阳儿，你起来

808
01:06:40,880 --> 01:06:42,960
Yang'er, let's go home.
阳儿，回家

809
01:06:45,160 --> 01:06:46,840
Dad won't scold you ever again.
爸再也不说你了

810
01:06:48,000 --> 01:06:50,240
Do whatever you want.
你愿意干啥你就干啥

811
01:06:52,480 --> 01:06:53,440
Get up.
起来

812
01:06:55,320 --> 01:06:57,040
Mom's still at home waiting for you.
妈还在家等你呢

813
01:06:58,800 --> 01:07:01,480
You and I still have to go to Beijing.
咱爷俩还得去北京

814
01:07:04,440 --> 01:07:05,440
Yang'er.
阳儿

815
01:07:06,440 --> 01:07:09,600
Yang'er... don't scare me.
阳儿…你别吓唬我

816
01:07:11,360 --> 01:07:13,640
Don't scare me, Yang'er.
你别吓我，阳儿

817
01:07:15,160 --> 01:07:17,440
Yang'er... don't...
阳儿…你别…

818
01:07:17,520 --> 01:07:23,080
Yang'er, don't scare your dad...
阳儿，你别吓唬爸…

819
01:07:25,640 --> 01:07:28,800
Don't scare your dad.
你别吓唬爸

820
01:07:45,520 --> 01:07:46,720
What flowers?
买啥花？

821
01:07:47,840 --> 01:07:49,320
What flowers do people give as gifts?
送人都选啥花呢？

822
01:07:49,400 --> 01:07:51,920
For visiting the sick, usually these — they bloom just in water.
看病人一般这种，插水就能开

823
01:07:52,000 --> 01:07:53,560
And they don't cause allergies.
而且不过敏

824
01:07:53,640 --> 01:07:56,360
Not for a patient — for a friend.
不看病人，送朋友

825
01:07:56,440 --> 01:07:59,400
You know, the... female kind of friend.
就是那种女的那个朋友

826
01:08:00,320 --> 01:08:01,320
Then let me give you a hand.
那我帮你搭一把吧

827
01:08:01,400 --> 01:08:02,360
Okay...
好…

828
01:08:02,440 --> 01:08:03,640
Boss.
老板

829
01:08:03,720 --> 01:08:05,000
-Just these, wrap them up for me.
-Sure.
-就要这些，帮我包一下
-好的

830
01:08:05,080 --> 01:08:07,840
-Sure... let me help him first.
-Okay...
-好的…我先帮他一下啊
-好…

831
01:08:17,040 --> 01:08:18,640
-Buying flowers?
-Buying flowers.
-买花？
-买花

832
01:08:23,280 --> 01:08:24,360
For your girlfriend?
送女朋友？

833
01:08:29,320 --> 01:08:30,880
Just get the same as mine.
你和我整一样的得了

834
01:08:31,520 --> 01:08:34,200
Eleven roses, two lilies.
11朵玫瑰，2朵百合

835
01:08:35,400 --> 01:08:36,960
Is there a meaning to it?
这有什么讲啊？

836
01:08:37,560 --> 01:08:39,960
Whole-hearted devotion, a hundred years of harmony.
一心一意，百年好合

837
01:08:41,400 --> 01:08:42,800
That's a lovely meaning.
这意思可好

838
01:08:43,719 --> 01:08:44,759
Very nice.
挺好

839
01:08:46,960 --> 01:08:48,440
Say, little brother,
老弟，你说

840
01:08:49,160 --> 01:08:51,759
I want to convey a bit of an apology too.
我想再表达一点歉意

841
01:08:51,840 --> 01:08:53,440
Just to say sorry, that sort of thing.
就是道个歉啥的

842
01:08:53,520 --> 01:08:55,200
What flower should I add for that?
再加点什么花呢？

843
01:08:55,759 --> 01:08:56,920
Add some forget-me-nots.
整点勿忘我

844
01:08:57,000 --> 01:08:58,160
Okay.
好

845
01:08:58,240 --> 01:09:01,240
"Don't forget me, don't hold it against me."
别忘了我，别挑我理

846
01:09:04,360 --> 01:09:05,520
Your flowers.
您的花

847
01:09:05,599 --> 01:09:06,719
Thanks, boss.
谢谢呀，老板

848
01:09:06,800 --> 01:09:08,080
-Take care.
-Thanks.
-慢走啊
-谢谢

849
01:09:08,800 --> 01:09:10,160
-Goodbye.
-Okay...
-再见
-好…

850
01:09:12,520 --> 01:09:14,120
Eleven roses,
11朵玫瑰

851
01:09:14,200 --> 01:09:15,719
two lilies,
两枝百合

852
01:09:15,800 --> 01:09:16,800
and extra forget-me-nots.
多加勿忘我

853
01:09:16,880 --> 01:09:18,200
-You got it.
-Extra.
-好咧，好
-多加

854
01:09:18,280 --> 01:09:19,360
Okay.
好

855
01:09:24,759 --> 01:09:26,480
Little brother, need a cab?
老弟，你打车呀？

856
01:09:27,040 --> 01:09:28,480
Here... I'll give you a ride, come on.
来…我拉你，来

857
01:09:29,040 --> 01:09:29,960
Is that all right?
方便吗？

858
01:09:30,040 --> 01:09:31,200
Don't you have somewhere to be?
你不有事吗？

859
01:09:31,280 --> 01:09:32,520
Where are you headed?
你要去哪啊？

860
01:09:33,080 --> 01:09:34,480
To Culture Street to pick someone up.
去文化街接个人

861
01:09:35,200 --> 01:09:36,880
Then hop in, it's right on the way.
那你上来吧，正好顺路

862
01:09:36,960 --> 01:09:38,360
No charge.
不要钱

863
01:09:38,880 --> 01:09:40,440
Thanks for being my advisor.
感谢你给我当参谋

864
01:09:40,520 --> 01:09:42,160
-Then I won't stand on ceremony.
-Good.
-那就不客气了
-好

865
01:09:43,920 --> 01:09:45,480
Here, hold this for me.
来，帮我拿一下

866
01:09:45,559 --> 01:09:46,440
Okay...
好…

867
01:09:46,520 --> 01:09:48,320
-Don't mix them up.
-Okay.
-别弄混了啊
-好

868
01:09:48,400 --> 01:09:50,800
-The one with forget-me-nots is mine.
-Okay.
-勿忘我那个是我的
-好

869
01:09:51,280 --> 01:09:52,200
Here.
来

870
01:10:01,520 --> 01:10:03,080
Off to see your girlfriend?
见女朋友去吧？

871
01:10:05,880 --> 01:10:07,480
Well... not exactly.
也…也不算

872
01:10:07,559 --> 01:10:09,360
We haven't made it official yet.
还没确定关系呢

873
01:10:10,160 --> 01:10:11,759
I plan to bring it up with her today.
今天准备跟她提

874
01:10:12,280 --> 01:10:13,759
I'm a bit unsure.
心里有点没底

875
01:10:14,599 --> 01:10:15,960
No problem.
没问题

876
01:10:17,000 --> 01:10:19,480
Little brother, with your air and bearing,
老弟呀，就你这个精神气质呀

877
01:10:19,560 --> 01:10:21,600
I'm telling you, one look and you're the refined type.
讲话了，一看儒雅

878
01:10:22,760 --> 01:10:24,280
There's no way it won't work out.
没有不成的道理

879
01:10:25,080 --> 01:10:26,440
From your lips to God's ears.
借你吉言

880
01:10:28,160 --> 01:10:29,640
What do you do for work?
干啥工作的？

881
01:10:31,040 --> 01:10:33,640
I used to teach in the academic office at No. 10 Middle School.
以前在十中教务处当老师

882
01:10:33,720 --> 01:10:34,840
Retired last year.
去年退了

883
01:10:35,360 --> 01:10:38,360
Let me tell you, I drive a cab every day,
我跟你说，我天天开计程车

884
01:10:38,440 --> 01:10:39,600
I meet a lot of people,
见的人多

885
01:10:40,080 --> 01:10:41,080
I've got a sharp eye.
眼睛毒

886
01:10:41,160 --> 01:10:43,000
One look and I can tell you're an educated man.
一看你就是个文化人

887
01:10:45,280 --> 01:10:47,160
You teachers,
你们当老师的

888
01:10:47,240 --> 01:10:49,360
your retirement benefits are pretty good, right?
退休待遇是不是挺高啊？

889
01:10:49,440 --> 01:10:50,560
They're all right, I suppose.
这还行吧

890
01:10:50,640 --> 01:10:52,760
Anyway, the pension goes up every year.
反正工资年年都涨

891
01:10:54,240 --> 01:10:55,880
My wife passed early.
我爱人没得早

892
01:10:56,440 --> 01:10:57,760
The kids are all on their own.
儿女也都独立了

893
01:10:57,840 --> 01:10:58,760
Now...
现在…

894
01:10:59,440 --> 01:11:00,800
I don't have big expenses.
没啥大花销

895
01:11:02,360 --> 01:11:04,120
So I get by fairly comfortably.
就算比较从容吧

896
01:11:04,960 --> 01:11:07,160
That's a good situation.
这条件不错

897
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:09,440
Find yourself a good companion,
再找个好老伴

898
01:11:10,000 --> 01:11:11,080
and your days
小日子

899
01:11:11,720 --> 01:11:12,880
would be just great.
老得劲了

900
01:11:20,120 --> 01:11:22,480
Qiaoyun, don't worry.
巧云，妳别着急

901
01:11:22,560 --> 01:11:23,960
I've got a cab.
打上车了啊

902
01:11:24,040 --> 01:11:25,080
I'll be there soon.
马上就到

903
01:11:35,840 --> 01:11:36,920
Little brother,
老弟

904
01:11:37,680 --> 01:11:41,520
was your... your girlfriend once with Hualin Steel?
你…你女朋友过去是桦钢的吗？

905
01:11:42,040 --> 01:11:43,160
Yes.
是呀

906
01:11:43,240 --> 01:11:45,400
Now she... she runs a massage parlor.
现…现在开家推拿店

907
01:11:45,480 --> 01:11:47,280
Why? You know her?
怎么的？ 你认识啊？

908
01:11:48,920 --> 01:11:50,920
The name sounds familiar.
名听着耳熟

909
01:11:52,560 --> 01:11:54,080
Might recognize her when I see her.
见面兴许能认识

910
01:11:54,840 --> 01:11:55,840
What a coincidence.
那可巧了

911
01:11:57,320 --> 01:11:59,120
She often mentions things about you folks at Hualin Steel.
她老提你们桦钢的事

912
01:11:59,840 --> 01:12:01,480
She just finished her retirement paperwork.
这不刚办完退休嘛

913
01:12:02,200 --> 01:12:04,280
She says she wants to close the massage parlor.
她说想把推拿店给关了

914
01:12:04,360 --> 01:12:07,360
Then the two of us will travel around, see some places.
到时候我俩就各地走一走，旅旅游

915
01:12:08,120 --> 01:12:10,040
Spend our later years together in peace, I suppose.
一起安度晚年吧就算

916
01:12:13,080 --> 01:12:15,440
Driver, turn at the Culture Street intersection.
师傅，文化街路口拐

917
01:12:20,640 --> 01:12:23,000
You... turn up ahead and just pull over.
你…你前面拐过去，给我靠边停就行

918
01:12:23,080 --> 01:12:24,560
She's waiting for me at the roadside.
她在道边等我呢

919
01:12:37,520 --> 01:12:38,760
Went and bought you flowers.
给妳买花去了

920
01:12:38,840 --> 01:12:40,120
These are yours.
这是您的

921
01:12:40,640 --> 01:12:42,040
It was hard to catch a cab over there.
那边不好打车

922
01:12:42,120 --> 01:12:44,280
Luckily I ran into this driver who gave me a lift.
正好遇上这师傅给我捎过来了

923
01:12:44,360 --> 01:12:45,880
He used to be with Hualin Steel too.
他以前也是桦钢的

924
01:12:45,960 --> 01:12:47,040
Isn't that a coincidence?
妳說巧不巧？

925
01:12:47,520 --> 01:12:48,440
Li Qiaoyun.
李巧云

926
01:12:48,920 --> 01:12:50,520
Are you Li Qiaoyun?
是不是李巧云？

927
01:12:51,640 --> 01:12:52,880
Do you remember?
想起来没？

928
01:12:53,920 --> 01:12:55,280
From the locomotive depot.
机务段的

929
01:12:57,040 --> 01:12:58,040
Surname Wang.
姓王

930
01:13:02,040 --> 01:13:03,720
I remember, Master Wang.
我记着，王师傅

931
01:13:05,240 --> 01:13:06,160
I remember.
记着呢

932
01:13:06,840 --> 01:13:07,800
What a coincidence.
巧了

933
01:13:09,200 --> 01:13:11,320
Shall we ride with him, then?
那咱还坐他车吧？

934
01:13:12,160 --> 01:13:14,040
Master Wang and I hit it off nicely.
我和王师傅聊得挺投机的

935
01:13:14,800 --> 01:13:16,160
We're going to Daguang Mall.
我们去大光商场

936
01:13:16,240 --> 01:13:18,080
Would you mind giving us a lift a bit further?
您再捎我们一段，方不方便？

937
01:13:18,160 --> 01:13:19,600
Sure...
方便…

938
01:13:19,680 --> 01:13:21,040
I can't drive you for free this time, though.
这回不能白拉了啊

939
01:13:21,120 --> 01:13:22,160
Okay...
好…

940
01:13:22,920 --> 01:13:24,840
Here, Qiaoyun, flowers for you.
来，巧云，送妳的花

941
01:13:34,040 --> 01:13:35,120
Are you hungry?
妳饿不饿？

942
01:13:35,880 --> 01:13:38,760
Should we eat first, or see the movie first?
一会咱俩是先吃饭，还是先看电影？

943
01:13:42,440 --> 01:13:43,440
Either's fine.
都行

944
01:13:45,920 --> 01:13:47,800
Then let's eat first.
那咱们就先吃饭

945
01:13:49,320 --> 01:13:51,080
Anything you feel like eating?
妳有啥想吃的没有？

946
01:13:52,120 --> 01:13:53,080
Anything's fine.
都行

947
01:13:54,760 --> 01:13:56,440
Okay, let me look it up.
好，我查查

948
01:14:10,800 --> 01:14:11,720
Master Wang.
王师傅

949
01:14:13,600 --> 01:14:16,240
Those flowers of yours are lovely.
你这花挺好看啊

950
01:14:18,600 --> 01:14:22,200
This little brother here helped me pick them.
是我这个老弟帮着选的

951
01:14:22,800 --> 01:14:24,600
Exactly the same as his.
跟他的一模一样

952
01:14:25,920 --> 01:14:27,840
Added some forget-me-nots.
加了点勿忘我

953
01:14:29,600 --> 01:14:30,880
It's just...
就是…

954
01:14:31,680 --> 01:14:33,160
"Don't hold a grudge against me."
别记恨我

955
01:14:34,160 --> 01:14:36,200
A bit of an apology.
有点道歉的意思

956
01:14:37,960 --> 01:14:39,480
Driving the two of us,
那你拉我俩

957
01:14:39,560 --> 01:14:41,160
won't it keep you from delivering your flowers?
不耽误你送花啊？

958
01:14:41,720 --> 01:14:42,880
It won't.
不耽误

959
01:14:43,960 --> 01:14:47,280
That person's also an old-timer from Hualin Steel.
那人也是桦钢的老人

960
01:14:47,360 --> 01:14:49,160
Whether I deliver them or not,
我送不送的

961
01:14:49,240 --> 01:14:51,280
she'll understand what I mean.
她都能明白我的意思

962
01:14:54,840 --> 01:14:57,240
Do I know this person you're giving flowers to?
你送花的这人我认识吗？

963
01:14:59,120 --> 01:15:00,520
You probably do.
应该认识

964
01:15:02,280 --> 01:15:04,200
She worked the weighbridge in the scale house.
她是磅房过磅的

965
01:15:06,240 --> 01:15:07,720
A good person.
人挺好

966
01:15:09,760 --> 01:15:11,960
She's had a hard life.
这辈子挺不容易的

967
01:15:12,840 --> 01:15:13,920
Proud and strong-willed.
要强

968
01:15:15,720 --> 01:15:18,800
But when other women ran into trouble,
可是别的女同志遇着点啥事

969
01:15:19,280 --> 01:15:20,640
they'd always cry and wail.
总是哭啼的

970
01:15:21,200 --> 01:15:22,560
She stayed cheerful.
她乐呵的

971
01:15:24,240 --> 01:15:26,000
Quite admirable.
挺让人佩服的

972
01:15:40,680 --> 01:15:43,800
So you never thought of taking things a step further with her?
那你就没想着跟她往前走一步呢？

973
01:15:49,520 --> 01:15:50,600
How to put it...
怎么回事呢？

974
01:15:50,680 --> 01:15:53,920
It's just, lately I've been through some things.
就是最近我遇着点事

975
01:15:55,160 --> 01:15:57,880
I've come across a lot of us old Hualin Steel folks.
接触不少我们桦钢的老人

976
01:15:58,640 --> 01:15:59,800
And I've realized,
我就发现啊

977
01:15:59,880 --> 01:16:03,480
no matter how they've fared, however their lives turned out,
人家不管过得好坏，活成啥样

978
01:16:03,560 --> 01:16:05,120
they can all look ahead.
都能往前看

979
01:16:05,680 --> 01:16:06,640
But not me.
我就不行

980
01:16:07,400 --> 01:16:09,080
I just can't get past it.
老过不去那个劲

981
01:16:10,040 --> 01:16:13,200
I heard this friend of mine is doing well now.
我听人说我这个朋友现在过得挺好

982
01:16:13,680 --> 01:16:15,120
After the bitter comes the sweet.
苦尽甘来

983
01:16:15,640 --> 01:16:17,320
I'm happy for her.
挺替她高兴的

984
01:16:18,360 --> 01:16:21,800
I just want her to live the rest of her life in comfort.
我就想让她后半辈子过得舒心一点

985
01:16:23,560 --> 01:16:26,760
Not to fret and worry over a little old man like me.
别跟我这个小老头担惊受怕

986
01:16:27,440 --> 01:16:28,640
All bottled up and wronged.
憋了吧屈的

987
01:16:29,160 --> 01:16:30,280
It's not worth it.
犯不上

988
01:16:31,120 --> 01:16:33,840
Master Wang, you're sentimental about the past.
王师傅，你这是念旧

989
01:16:35,520 --> 01:16:37,120
Sentimental, if you want to put it nicely.
说好听是念旧

990
01:16:38,200 --> 01:16:39,880
Really it's just being stubborn to a fault.
其实就是爱钻牛角尖

991
01:16:40,560 --> 01:16:41,680
Not quick in the head.
脑袋不灵活

992
01:16:42,600 --> 01:16:43,760
Pretty annoying.
挺烦人的

993
01:16:48,360 --> 01:16:50,080
Why are you crying, Qiaoyun?
妳怎么哭了，巧云？

994
01:16:51,600 --> 01:16:52,600
It's nothing.
没事

995
01:16:56,080 --> 01:16:57,240
It's nothing.
没事

996
01:16:58,440 --> 01:17:01,600
I was just remembering some things from the past too.
我也是想起点过去的事

997
01:17:03,080 --> 01:17:04,360
Take my word.
信我的

998
01:17:05,600 --> 01:17:07,200
Don't dwell on the past.
不想过去的事

999
01:17:07,680 --> 01:17:09,640
What's past, let it stay past.
过去了就让它过去

1000
01:17:10,120 --> 01:17:11,160
Look ahead.
往前看

1001
01:17:13,720 --> 01:17:14,680
Right.
对

1002
01:17:15,440 --> 01:17:16,680
Look ahead.
往前看

1003
01:17:19,120 --> 01:17:20,320
Look ahead.
往前看

1004
01:17:34,240 --> 01:17:35,440
Master Wang, how much?
王师傅，多少钱？

1005
01:17:35,920 --> 01:17:37,320
No charge, little brother.
不用掏钱了，老弟

1006
01:17:37,800 --> 01:17:39,360
Just do me one favor.
有个事拜托一下

1007
01:17:40,320 --> 01:17:42,680
Be good to our Qiaoyun from now on.
以后对我们巧云好点

1008
01:17:43,160 --> 01:17:45,400
Or us old workmates won't stand for it.
不然我们老工友们不答应你

1009
01:17:46,400 --> 01:17:47,680
I will...
一定…

1010
01:17:47,760 --> 01:17:48,800
Thank you.
谢谢呀

1011
01:17:52,400 --> 01:17:54,120
Qiaoyun, let's get out.
巧云，下车啊

1012
01:17:58,800 --> 01:18:00,360
Thank you, Master Wang.
谢谢呀，王师傅

1013
01:18:07,160 --> 01:18:08,160
Little brother.
老弟呀

1014
01:18:12,040 --> 01:18:13,320
I wish you both well.
祝福你们

1015
01:18:13,880 --> 01:18:15,560
-This...
-I'm past my use now.
-这…
-我没用了我

1016
01:18:17,720 --> 01:18:19,200
Forget-me-not.
勿忘我啊

1017
01:18:20,320 --> 01:18:22,760
Thank you...
谢谢…

1018
01:18:29,320 --> 01:18:31,320
Master Wang's a really warm person.
王师傅这人真挺热情

1019
01:18:38,360 --> 01:18:39,640
His name is Wang Xiang.
他叫王响

1020
01:18:40,240 --> 01:18:41,760
"Xiang" as in "xiangliang" — resounding.
“响亮”的“响”

1021
01:18:54,440 --> 01:18:55,480
Biaozi.
彪子

1022
01:18:57,360 --> 01:18:59,320
This matter's settled now.
这事就算完了

1023
01:18:59,400 --> 01:19:01,200
These few copies are yours.
这几份是你的

1024
01:19:02,400 --> 01:19:03,800
Keep them safe.
都拿好了

1025
01:19:06,600 --> 01:19:08,120
Give me that license too.
把那证也给我吧

1026
01:19:09,600 --> 01:19:10,880
What do you want that license for?
你要这证干啥？

1027
01:19:10,960 --> 01:19:12,240
It's void now.
都作废了

1028
01:19:12,320 --> 01:19:13,920
I'll... keep it as a memento.
我…我留个纪念

1029
01:19:14,000 --> 01:19:15,920
It's got my photo on it.
那上边还有我照片呢

1030
01:19:16,520 --> 01:19:17,440
Fine.
得

1031
01:19:18,040 --> 01:19:19,600
I've already arranged it with someone.
我都跟人说好了

1032
01:19:19,680 --> 01:19:21,520
I'll drive the car over by the end of the month.
月底把车开过去啊

1033
01:19:21,600 --> 01:19:22,440
Don't worry.
放心吧

1034
01:19:22,520 --> 01:19:24,560
I'll clean it up nice and deliver it to you.
到时候我整干净的，给你送过去

1035
01:19:24,640 --> 01:19:25,640
Okay.
行

1036
01:19:26,440 --> 01:19:27,480
Thanks.
谢谢啊

1037
01:19:32,480 --> 01:19:34,480
(Hualin City Taxi Driver Service Qualification License)
（桦林市计程车汽车驾驶员 服务资格证）

1038
01:19:59,240 --> 01:20:01,080
Your sign would look so much better hung over there.
你这牌挂那边多好啊

1039
01:20:01,160 --> 01:20:02,400
So much more eye-catching.
多醒目啊

1040
01:20:02,960 --> 01:20:05,360
Hung there, people coming from that side can't even see it.
你挂那，从那边过来，人也看不见啊

1041
01:20:06,040 --> 01:20:06,880
Who are you?
你谁呀？

1042
01:20:06,960 --> 01:20:07,960
Who am I?
我谁呀？

1043
01:20:08,040 --> 01:20:09,880
I'm the owner of this shop, who am I?
我这店老板，我谁呀？

1044
01:20:12,200 --> 01:20:13,280
Thanks for your hard work.
辛苦了啊

1045
01:20:14,360 --> 01:20:15,200
Thanks, boss.
谢谢老板

1046
01:20:15,280 --> 01:20:16,280
Here, catch.
接好了

1047
01:20:18,040 --> 01:20:19,000
Been too busy lately.
最近太忙了

1048
01:20:19,080 --> 01:20:20,200
Haven't come by much.
没怎么过来看

1049
01:20:20,680 --> 01:20:21,760
Where's your Boss Huang?
你们黄总呢？

1050
01:20:22,560 --> 01:20:23,840
Inside, I take it?
在屋里吧？

1051
01:20:24,760 --> 01:20:26,600
All right, you all get to it.
那行，你们好好整吧

1052
01:20:26,680 --> 01:20:28,000
Hang it over here.
挂这边啊

1053
01:20:39,800 --> 01:20:42,320
Master, mainly you've got to smooth out the edges and corners up top.
师傅，你主要上边 那边边角角得抹好了

1054
01:20:42,400 --> 01:20:43,960
-You know? Then let it dry all the way through.
-You got it.
-你知道吗？ 然后得干透啊
-好咧

1055
01:20:44,040 --> 01:20:45,880
-Once it's fully dry, do a second coat.
-Sure.
-干透完了抹第二遍
-行

1056
01:20:51,480 --> 01:20:52,360
What are you doing here?
你怎么来了？

1057
01:20:53,760 --> 01:20:55,600
Coming along quite nicely.
整得挺像样啊

1058
01:20:57,280 --> 01:20:59,240
Whatever it is, say it at home; I'm swamped here.
你有啥事回家说吧，我这老忙了

1059
01:20:59,320 --> 01:21:01,360
Look at this place, all in a mess.
你瞅这，弄得乱糟糟的

1060
01:21:01,880 --> 01:21:04,320
You don't answer my calls, don't reply on WeChat.
我给妳打电话也不接，微信也不回

1061
01:21:05,200 --> 01:21:06,040
What's wrong?
怎么的了？

1062
01:21:06,640 --> 01:21:08,440
Trying to spring a surprise on me?
想给我整个意外惊喜啊？

1063
01:21:09,200 --> 01:21:10,560
What surprise?
什么意外惊喜？

1064
01:21:11,600 --> 01:21:13,040
Don't be angry now.
别生气了啊

1065
01:21:13,640 --> 01:21:15,480
So petty.
心眼那小呢

1066
01:21:15,560 --> 01:21:17,120
Enough, stop the tugging and pulling here.
行了，别在这拉拉扯扯的

1067
01:21:17,200 --> 01:21:18,120
What's the matter with you?
干什么玩意？

1068
01:21:18,200 --> 01:21:19,240
Is this going to go on forever?
没完没了了？

1069
01:21:19,320 --> 01:21:22,240
-What? Stop yanking me, that hurts.
-What's going on, Liru?
-干什么？ 你别老拽我，我疼
-怎么了，丽茹？

1070
01:21:24,280 --> 01:21:25,360
Who's this?
这谁啊？

1071
01:21:26,760 --> 01:21:28,200
My husband, Gong Biao.
我爱人，龚彪

1072
01:21:30,240 --> 01:21:31,480
This is Brother Hao.
这是郝哥

1073
01:21:31,960 --> 01:21:32,920
Biaozi?
彪子？

1074
01:21:33,480 --> 01:21:34,920
Liru's always mentioning you.
老听丽茹提你

1075
01:21:37,400 --> 01:21:39,200
How come you're not out driving today?
你今儿怎么没出车呀？

1076
01:21:40,400 --> 01:21:41,360
Who's this?
谁呀？

1077
01:21:41,920 --> 01:21:44,080
Brother Hao? A business partner.
郝哥吗？ 合伙人

1078
01:21:46,040 --> 01:21:47,200
Brother Hao.
郝哥呀

1079
01:21:49,000 --> 01:21:50,440
Quite the stylish one.
挺有派呀

1080
01:21:51,360 --> 01:21:52,640
What line of work?
干啥工作的？

1081
01:21:52,720 --> 01:21:53,920
A little business here and there.
做点小买卖

1082
01:21:55,400 --> 01:21:57,280
Just bought into Boss Huang's place here.
这不刚在黄总这入股嘛

1083
01:21:57,960 --> 01:22:01,040
I've got a few repair shops over in Daowai too.
我在道外还有几家维修厂

1084
01:22:01,120 --> 01:22:02,920
Anything wrong with your car, just come by.
你的车有啥毛病直接过去

1085
01:22:03,000 --> 01:22:03,880
Just mention my name.
提我就行啊

1086
01:22:03,960 --> 01:22:05,520
-Here.
-I'm not used to these.
-来
-我抽不惯这个

1087
01:22:06,120 --> 01:22:07,360
Nothing's wrong with my car.
我车没问题

1088
01:22:07,440 --> 01:22:09,280
What I've got now is a problem with my marriage.
我现在感情有问题

1089
01:22:09,360 --> 01:22:10,240
Can you fix that?
能修啊？

1090
01:22:12,160 --> 01:22:13,800
What do you mean, Biaozi?
啥意思呀，彪子？

1091
01:22:13,880 --> 01:22:15,600
Watch your words.
说话注意点分寸啊

1092
01:22:15,680 --> 01:22:16,800
Don't call me Biaozi.
别彪子

1093
01:22:16,880 --> 01:22:18,360
Is "Biaozi" for you to say?
彪子是你叫的？

1094
01:22:18,440 --> 01:22:19,400
Call me Brother Biao.
叫彪哥

1095
01:22:19,480 --> 01:22:21,720
What's this? Why are you bickering with people?
怎么说的？ 跟人吵吵嚷嚷干啥？

1096
01:22:21,800 --> 01:22:23,560
What are you staring at? Get back to work.
你看啥看呢？ 干你活

1097
01:22:23,640 --> 01:22:25,160
-What's it got to do with him?
-It's fine.
-跟人家有什么关系呀？
-没事

1098
01:22:25,240 --> 01:22:26,880
Come on, let's talk outside, come.
来，出来说，来

1099
01:22:29,520 --> 01:22:31,480
No, where'd this Brother Hao come from?
不，哪冒出这么个郝哥呀？

1100
01:22:31,560 --> 01:22:32,640
What's so great about him?
他哪好他呀？

1101
01:22:32,720 --> 01:22:34,280
Acting so arrogant with me.
跟我这嚣张的

1102
01:22:34,360 --> 01:22:35,720
What exactly is between you two?
你俩到底啥关系呀？

1103
01:22:36,200 --> 01:22:37,520
Do you have amnesia or something?
你是不是有健忘症啊你？

1104
01:22:37,600 --> 01:22:38,800
Didn't I just tell you inside?
我里面跟你说没说？

1105
01:22:38,880 --> 01:22:39,960
A business partner.
合伙人

1106
01:22:40,040 --> 01:22:42,360
He puts up the money, I provide the skills — anything wrong with that?
人家出钱，我出技术，有毛病吗？

1107
01:22:42,920 --> 01:22:44,320
Why go into business with him?
妳跟他合啥伙啊？

1108
01:22:44,400 --> 01:22:46,200
Isn't building a life together its own partnership, just us two?
那过日子不咱俩合伙吗？

1109
01:22:48,440 --> 01:22:50,720
If you're going to think dirty like that, then there's nothing to discuss.
你要是往那脏里想，咱俩就不用唠了

1110
01:22:51,360 --> 01:22:52,240
No, Liru.
不是，丽茹

1111
01:22:52,720 --> 01:22:53,720
I didn't mean it that way.
我没那意思

1112
01:22:53,800 --> 01:22:54,720
What's the matter with you?
干什么玩意？

1113
01:22:54,800 --> 01:22:56,800
You ignore my messages just to spite me, don't you?
妳不回我信不就为了气我吗？

1114
01:22:57,600 --> 01:22:59,680
Buying the car behind your back — I was in the wrong, true.
我偷摸买车这事确实干得不对

1115
01:23:00,360 --> 01:23:02,240
But haven't I sincerely apologized to you already?
我不已经郑重给妳道歉了吗？

1116
01:23:03,600 --> 01:23:05,880
Besides, even the worst offense has its limit.
再说杀人不过头点地呢

1117
01:23:06,960 --> 01:23:09,760
A married couple quarrels at the head of the bed and makes up at the foot, right?
那夫妻俩不就床头吵吵床尾合吗？

1118
01:23:10,800 --> 01:23:12,880
Besides, I've been staying at my brother-in-law's these past few days.
另外，这几天我一直住姐夫家呢

1119
01:23:12,960 --> 01:23:14,160
I haven't been anywhere.
我哪都没去

1120
01:23:14,240 --> 01:23:15,560
You can be absolutely sure of that.
这点妳绝对放心

1121
01:23:16,080 --> 01:23:17,400
I'm not worried.
我没不放心

1122
01:23:18,240 --> 01:23:19,840
I couldn't care less.
我压根就不关心

1123
01:23:22,640 --> 01:23:24,080
Give me a little more time.
妳再给我点时间

1124
01:23:24,160 --> 01:23:25,440
We won't use anyone else's money.
咱不用别人钱了

1125
01:23:29,480 --> 01:23:30,760
Biaozi, it's not about money for us.
彪子，咱俩不是钱的事

1126
01:23:30,840 --> 01:23:32,320
My divorcing you isn't about money.
我跟你离婚不是钱的事

1127
01:23:32,400 --> 01:23:34,960
Then I don't get it — what else is it about?
那我就闹不明白了，妳还因为啥呀？

1128
01:23:35,040 --> 01:23:36,480
Because I don't want to be with you anymore.
因为我不想跟你过了

1129
01:23:37,160 --> 01:23:38,440
Understand?
听明白没？

1130
01:23:38,520 --> 01:23:40,640
Enough. I'm done.
够了，不想过了

1131
01:24:09,720 --> 01:24:10,960
Careful...
你慢点…

1132
01:24:11,480 --> 01:24:12,880
Let me hold it for you.
我给你捧着吧

1133
01:24:12,960 --> 01:24:14,160
Look, your suit's all smudged.
你瞅这西服都蹭脏了

1134
01:24:14,240 --> 01:24:15,840
It's fine, it's just work.
没事，干活嘛

1135
01:24:32,360 --> 01:24:33,480
What? Something else?
怎的？ 还有事啊？

1136
01:24:34,440 --> 01:24:35,320
No.
没有了

1137
01:24:35,400 --> 01:24:36,440
I'm heading back.
回去了

1138
01:24:38,840 --> 01:24:39,880
Liru.
丽茹

1139
01:24:42,120 --> 01:24:44,320
Come home tonight, let's have a proper talk.
晚上回家吧，咱好好聊聊

1140
01:25:07,840 --> 01:25:08,880
You're back, Biaozi?
回来了，彪子？

1141
01:25:08,960 --> 01:25:10,040
The jackpot hasn't been drawn yet.
大奖还没出呢

1142
01:25:10,120 --> 01:25:11,120
Buy a couple more tickets.
再来两注吧

1143
01:25:11,640 --> 01:25:12,800
I'm not that lucky.
没那命

1144
01:25:22,120 --> 01:25:23,040
Here.
来

1145
01:25:25,200 --> 01:25:26,360
Eat up, all of you.
都吃饱点

1146
01:25:27,200 --> 01:25:28,640
Full bellies fly far.
吃饱了，飞得远

1147
01:25:41,680 --> 01:25:43,720
Are you ever going to clean up your pigeon droppings?
你家那鸽子屎还能不能收拾了？

1148
01:25:44,720 --> 01:25:45,960
How many times have I said it?
说多少回了都？

1149
01:25:46,520 --> 01:25:47,720
Stinking the place up every single day.
天天整得臭气熏天的

1150
01:25:47,800 --> 01:25:49,240
It's affecting the kids' studies.
都影响孩子学习了

1151
01:25:49,880 --> 01:25:51,080
Stop nagging.
别吵吵了

1152
01:25:51,640 --> 01:25:53,800
Go home and help your kid with homework.
赶紧回家辅导妳孩子学习吧

1153
01:25:54,320 --> 01:25:55,720
I'm cleaning it up, aren't I?
这不收拾吗？

1154
01:25:56,440 --> 01:25:58,360
Soon you won't be able to smell them even if you wanted to.
以后想闻都闻不着了

1155
01:25:58,440 --> 01:25:59,560
Get on with it.
赶紧的吧

1156
01:26:18,760 --> 01:26:19,960
Had enough to eat?
吃饱了吗？

1157
01:26:24,720 --> 01:26:26,000
Full now?
吃饱了吧？

1158
01:27:17,840 --> 01:27:18,840
You're back.
回来了

1159
01:27:21,840 --> 01:27:23,320
Haven't made this in years.
多少年不做了

1160
01:27:23,400 --> 01:27:25,120
Have a taste — is it still the same?
尝尝，还是那味不？

1161
01:27:30,960 --> 01:27:32,000
What is it?
怎么了？

1162
01:27:32,920 --> 01:27:34,600
The way you're looking at me gives me the creeps.
妳看得我直发毛

1163
01:27:40,200 --> 01:27:42,360
Come on, Biaozi, if something's up, just say it.
不是，彪子，你有啥事你就说吧

1164
01:27:42,440 --> 01:27:44,120
Um... they're renovating my shop soon,
那啥…我那店里面一会还装修

1165
01:27:44,200 --> 01:27:45,360
I've got to keep an eye on it.
我得盯着

1166
01:27:47,280 --> 01:27:48,640
In such a hurry?
那么着急啊？

1167
01:27:51,000 --> 01:27:52,240
It's our last meal.
最后一顿饭

1168
01:27:52,920 --> 01:27:54,400
Finish it before you go.
吃完再回去吧

1169
01:27:57,200 --> 01:27:58,400
What do you mean?
啥意思啊？

1170
01:28:00,400 --> 01:28:02,240
I've drawn up a divorce agreement.
我拟了一份离婚协议

1171
01:28:02,320 --> 01:28:03,800
Take a look at it later.
妳回头看一眼

1172
01:28:04,600 --> 01:28:06,000
I've already signed it.
我已经签完字了

1173
01:28:06,600 --> 01:28:07,640
I want nothing.
我啥都不要

1174
01:28:08,160 --> 01:28:09,840
The savings, the house — all yours.
存款、房子都归妳

1175
01:28:10,520 --> 01:28:12,960
As for the pigeons, they're gone even if you wanted them.
那鸽子妳想要也没有了

1176
01:28:13,040 --> 01:28:14,120
I let them all go.
我都放了

1177
01:28:15,000 --> 01:28:16,960
No problem, just sign and it's done.
没啥问题，签个字就完事了

1178
01:28:44,600 --> 01:28:46,640
Have a bowl of soup, it'll get cold.
喝碗汤吧，一会凉了

1179
01:28:46,720 --> 01:28:48,120
All right, I'll serve it.
行了，我盛吧

1180
01:28:48,200 --> 01:28:49,760
You never lift a finger normally.
平时啥都不沾手

1181
01:28:57,560 --> 01:29:00,920
Liru, I've thought it through, really.
丽茹，我想明白了，真的

1182
01:29:02,240 --> 01:29:03,480
All these years,
反正这些年

1183
01:29:03,960 --> 01:29:05,840
you've suffered plenty with me.
妳也跟我遭了不少罪

1184
01:29:07,560 --> 01:29:09,040
Never got to enjoy much.
也没享着啥福

1185
01:29:11,080 --> 01:29:12,800
And I've got nothing to give you.
我也没啥能给妳的

1186
01:29:14,080 --> 01:29:16,000
My life's already turned out this way.
反正我这辈子就这样了

1187
01:29:16,600 --> 01:29:18,000
I just want you to be well.
就希望妳好

1188
01:29:24,960 --> 01:29:26,840
Think you're pretty noble, don't you?
觉得你自己挺伟大吧？

1189
01:29:27,400 --> 01:29:28,800
Naturally.
那必须的

1190
01:29:29,360 --> 01:29:30,920
A '90s college graduate, after all.
90年代大学生嘛

1191
01:29:31,000 --> 01:29:32,440
No good at much else,
别的啥啥不行

1192
01:29:32,520 --> 01:29:34,480
but the refined air, that I've got down.
气质这块必须拿捏呀

1193
01:29:45,200 --> 01:29:47,360
Hurry and eat, it's getting cold.
赶紧吃吧，凉了

1194
01:29:47,440 --> 01:29:48,600
Do me the honor.
给点面子

1195
01:30:01,160 --> 01:30:02,680
When does your shop open?
妳店啥时候开呀？

1196
01:30:03,440 --> 01:30:04,560
By the end of the year.
年底就能开

1197
01:30:05,280 --> 01:30:06,400
What's it called?
叫啥名？

1198
01:30:07,400 --> 01:30:08,720
Haven't decided on a name yet.
名没想好呢

1199
01:30:09,280 --> 01:30:11,280
You're the educated one — think one up for me.
你挺有文化，你帮我想一个吧

1200
01:30:12,440 --> 01:30:13,880
What would I know?
我瞎想啥呀？

1201
01:30:14,520 --> 01:30:16,000
Your partner might not go for it anyway.
妳那合伙人也未必答应

1202
01:30:18,640 --> 01:30:19,560
All right.
行

1203
01:30:20,080 --> 01:30:21,440
I'll say no more.
别的不说了

1204
01:30:22,480 --> 01:30:24,520
Today I'll toast with soup in place of wine.
我今天就以汤代酒了

1205
01:30:24,600 --> 01:30:25,880
I'll drink first, in your honor.
先干为敬

1206
01:30:34,000 --> 01:30:35,920
Don't drink that soup, I made it too salty.
那汤妳别喝了，整咸了

1207
01:30:37,080 --> 01:30:38,360
It'll bother your throat.
弄得嗓子不舒服

1208
01:30:44,560 --> 01:30:45,520
All right.
行

1209
01:30:46,040 --> 01:30:47,760
Anyway, this is settled today.
反正这事今天就定下了

1210
01:30:48,600 --> 01:30:49,600
Liru.
丽茹

1211
01:30:50,880 --> 01:30:52,080
I wish you happiness.
祝妳幸福

1212
01:31:04,760 --> 01:31:06,480
I've left the keys by the door for you.
钥匙我给妳放门口了

1213
01:31:08,240 --> 01:31:09,440
Biaozi.
彪子

1214
01:31:15,520 --> 01:31:17,640
I thought of a name for your shop.
妳那店名我给妳想了一个

1215
01:31:19,080 --> 01:31:20,440
Let's call it "Rumeng" — Like a Dream.
就叫如梦吧

1216
01:31:21,000 --> 01:31:22,120
How's that?
怎么样？

1217
01:31:24,280 --> 01:31:26,200
All those years we spent together,
咱俩一起过那么多年

1218
01:31:27,880 --> 01:31:31,440
it always felt like a dream.
老觉得像作一场梦似的

1219
01:31:35,080 --> 01:31:36,680
Now the dream's over.
现在梦醒了

1220
01:31:38,200 --> 01:31:39,760
From now on, let's both be well.
以后咱俩都好好的

1221
01:31:46,440 --> 01:31:47,800
Both be well.
都好好的

1222
01:31:49,240 --> 01:31:51,080
"Rumeng" is a fine name.
就叫如梦挺好

1223
01:32:06,280 --> 01:32:07,680
Life is short.
人生苦短

1224
01:32:08,240 --> 01:32:09,880
Just like Biaozi said,
就像彪子说那样

1225
01:32:10,680 --> 01:32:12,400
life is but a dream.
人生就是一场梦

1226
01:32:13,320 --> 01:32:15,240
I learned a saying recently.
最近学了一句话

1227
01:32:15,840 --> 01:32:19,160
It goes: of life's disappointments,
叫人生不如意的事

1228
01:32:19,240 --> 01:32:20,720
there are eight or nine in ten.
十有八九

1229
01:32:21,400 --> 01:32:24,320
Those you can share your heart with
能说几句心里话的人

1230
01:32:24,400 --> 01:32:26,000
number but two or three.
也就二三

1231
01:32:26,560 --> 01:32:31,360
And as it happens, two bosom friends are right here beside me.
恰好两位知己朋友就在我的身边

1232
01:32:31,440 --> 01:32:33,240
That's enough for one life.
人生足矣

1233
01:32:33,320 --> 01:32:35,600
Come on, brother-in-law, where'd you pick up this talk?
不是，姐夫，你这从哪学的嗑？

1234
01:32:35,680 --> 01:32:37,800
-A whole routine.
-Words from the heart.
-一套一套的
-肺腑之言

1235
01:32:38,480 --> 01:32:40,240
"The Place Where Peach Blossoms Bloom."
《桃花盛开的地方》

1236
01:32:40,320 --> 01:32:41,640
I dedicate it to you.
送给你们

1237
01:32:41,720 --> 01:32:48,720
In that place where the peach blossoms bloom...
在那桃花盛开的地方

1238
01:32:50,080 --> 01:32:52,760
Old Ma... what are you doing?
老马头…干啥呢？

1239
01:32:52,840 --> 01:32:55,040
Um... calling it a night?
那个…收摊了？

1240
01:32:55,120 --> 01:32:56,400
What do you mean, calling it a night?
收啥收摊呀？

1241
01:32:56,920 --> 01:32:58,400
I even brought my insulin.
我胰岛素都带来了

1242
01:32:58,480 --> 01:32:59,560
I came to spend the night with you.
我陪你睡觉来了

1243
01:32:59,640 --> 01:33:00,520
Come on.
来

1244
01:33:01,040 --> 01:33:02,960
Nobody leaves without partying all night, come on.
今天不玩一宿不许走啊，来

1245
01:33:03,040 --> 01:33:04,920
-Aren't you afraid of getting wrecked?
-Thanks.
-这不怕被干废了呀？
-谢谢

1246
01:33:05,000 --> 01:33:06,440
We'll see who ends up wrecked.
谁废还不知道呢

1247
01:33:07,080 --> 01:33:08,680
Xiao Li's still at home waiting for me.
小李还在家等着我呢

1248
01:33:09,680 --> 01:33:10,720
No need to worry about your dog.
你家狗不用操心

1249
01:33:10,800 --> 01:33:12,520
-It was raised on coffee.
-Thanks.
-它喝咖啡长大的
-谢谢

1250
01:33:13,880 --> 01:33:16,320
Homeland...
故乡

1251
01:33:16,400 --> 01:33:19,840
the place that bore me and raised me...
生我、养我的地方

1252
01:33:21,040 --> 01:33:24,440
wherever I stand guard on watch...
无论我在哪里放哨站岗…

1253
01:33:25,960 --> 01:33:26,840
This one's good.
这个好

1254
01:33:27,400 --> 01:33:30,160
My brother-in-law spared no expense today, you know?
我姐夫今天下血本了，知道不？

1255
01:33:30,640 --> 01:33:32,320
I've known this liquor for twenty years.
我认识这酒20年了

1256
01:33:32,800 --> 01:33:34,760
I used to have to call this liquor "grandpa."
以前我得管这酒叫大爷

1257
01:33:35,240 --> 01:33:36,920
Any longer and it'll be my ancestor.
再不喝以后成我祖宗了

1258
01:33:37,480 --> 01:33:39,000
When life gives you joy, drink your fill of it.
人生得意须尽欢

1259
01:33:39,080 --> 01:33:40,080
Never mind ancestor or grandpa,
你别管祖宗、大爷

1260
01:33:40,160 --> 01:33:41,440
you've just got to drink it, right?
你就得整，是不？

1261
01:33:41,520 --> 01:33:42,720
You've got to be happy.
你得高兴

1262
01:33:44,560 --> 01:33:47,040
How many years have we sung this lousy song, brother-in-law?
我说这破歌唱多少年了，姐夫

1263
01:33:47,640 --> 01:33:49,760
Put on something livelier — have Captain Ma dance one.
你点个刺激点的，你让马队跳一个

1264
01:33:49,840 --> 01:33:51,120
-We're all sleepy.
-Okay.
-都困了
-好

1265
01:33:51,200 --> 01:33:56,080
Young man, give us this KTV's most electrifying dance number.
小伙，把本KTV 最刺激的舞曲奉献出来

1266
01:33:56,160 --> 01:33:57,160
You got it.
好咧

1267
01:33:59,000 --> 01:34:00,240
Don't cause any trouble.
别整事啊

1268
01:34:01,920 --> 01:34:04,520
And now, presenting Hualin's Dance King,
下面有请桦林舞王

1269
01:34:05,040 --> 01:34:09,600
Ma-lon De-bran-sheng, taking the stage in dazzling style!
马龙德兰胜闪亮登场

1270
01:34:12,880 --> 01:34:14,160
Not even a dance partner.
也没个舞伴

1271
01:34:14,680 --> 01:34:15,680
So lonely.
好孤独啊

1272
01:34:16,360 --> 01:34:18,320
Hold on, "Hualin Dance King" — why can't I take that lying down?
不是，他桦林舞王 我怎么那么不服呢？

1273
01:34:18,400 --> 01:34:21,320
Back in the disco days, I was somebody at Hualin Tech too.
那当年迪斯科 我也是桦工大有一号啊

1274
01:34:21,400 --> 01:34:23,480
Then everybody, come on.
那就全都来着

1275
01:34:23,560 --> 01:34:24,400
Come on.
来

1276
01:35:03,760 --> 01:35:05,120
Here, keep drinking.
来，接着喝

1277
01:35:07,440 --> 01:35:08,440
Here, Captain Ma.
来，马队

1278
01:35:09,560 --> 01:35:10,480
Captain Ma.
马队

1279
01:35:11,040 --> 01:35:11,960
Come on.
来

1280
01:35:13,400 --> 01:35:14,520
No more for me.
不喝了

1281
01:35:15,200 --> 01:35:16,280
I'm going home.
回家

1282
01:35:17,200 --> 01:35:18,560
Old Ma, you're no fun.
老马头，你这没意思了

1283
01:35:19,160 --> 01:35:20,040
Where's your stamina?
啥体力呀？

1284
01:35:20,120 --> 01:35:21,520
Always talking yourself up.
还总给我拉硬的

1285
01:35:23,200 --> 01:35:24,560
I'm getting old.
我老了

1286
01:35:40,720 --> 01:35:42,520
How did we ever get through this life of ours?
你说咱这辈子怎么过来的？

1287
01:35:44,320 --> 01:35:46,200
Sometimes I try to recall something,
有时候总想回忆点啥

1288
01:35:47,160 --> 01:35:50,160
I rack my brain, and I can't remember a thing.
寻思半天，啥也记不起来了

1289
01:35:54,000 --> 01:35:55,000
Biaozi.
彪子

1290
01:35:56,960 --> 01:35:58,720
Not remembering is a good thing.
记不住是好事

1291
01:36:01,640 --> 01:36:02,800
Some things,
有些事

1292
01:36:03,760 --> 01:36:05,760
what should be remembered, we remember.
该记着咱就记着

1293
01:36:06,680 --> 01:36:08,800
What should be forgotten, we absolutely forget.
该忘了绝对要忘

1294
01:36:10,000 --> 01:36:11,360
Right, Captain Ma?
对不对，马队？

1295
01:36:11,440 --> 01:36:12,720
What's this?
怎么的？

1296
01:36:13,920 --> 01:36:15,720
Are we really splitting up for good this time?
这回真散伙了？

1297
01:36:17,240 --> 01:36:18,280
Splitting up.
散伙

1298
01:36:19,120 --> 01:36:21,040
Each to his own home, each to his own mother.
各回各家，各找各妈

1299
01:36:22,160 --> 01:36:28,200
I sincerely thank you two good brothers for all your care and effort these past days.
老哥对二位贤弟 这些日子的费心费力表示衷心的感谢

1300
01:36:28,280 --> 01:36:30,080
Come on, drink.
来，喝酒

1301
01:36:30,160 --> 01:36:32,000
I don't like hearing you talk like that.
我不爱听你说这话

1302
01:36:33,200 --> 01:36:34,920
There are things I can't forget.
有些事我忘不了

1303
01:36:36,080 --> 01:36:37,800
This isn't your burden alone.
这不是你一个人的事

1304
01:36:40,440 --> 01:36:43,160
I'll see this through to the end, for sure.
这事我肯定整到底

1305
01:36:43,240 --> 01:36:44,840
That animal...
那畜生啊…

1306
01:36:53,880 --> 01:36:54,920
Biaozi.
彪子

1307
01:36:56,560 --> 01:36:58,480
When I was young,
我年轻的时候

1308
01:36:59,440 --> 01:37:01,360
I sure as hell didn't believe in fate.
特他妈不信命

1309
01:37:03,120 --> 01:37:05,800
The older I get, the more I see I was wrong.
我越老越发现我错了

1310
01:37:07,600 --> 01:37:10,760
Our fates were all set in stone.
咱这命都给定下来了

1311
01:37:15,600 --> 01:37:16,960
Who arranged it?
谁安排的？

1312
01:37:19,560 --> 01:37:21,720
Are we just meant to have the fate we've got?
咱这命就活该就这命吧？

1313
01:37:24,320 --> 01:37:25,680
Why can't I accept it?
我怎么不服呢？

1314
01:37:26,440 --> 01:37:28,360
Bring him here, I'll have a good talk with him.
你叫他过来，我跟他好好唠唠

1315
01:37:33,560 --> 01:37:34,880
If I could find him,
我要是能找着他

1316
01:37:34,960 --> 01:37:36,680
I'd fight him to the death.
我肯定跟他玩命

1317
01:37:41,320 --> 01:37:42,640
Listen to me, brother-in-law.
听我的吧，姐夫

1318
01:37:42,720 --> 01:37:44,200
If we're going to live, let's live happily.
活咱就活得乐呵的

1319
01:37:44,280 --> 01:37:45,760
We'll deal with it when we find him.
啥时候找着他再说

1320
01:37:50,920 --> 01:37:52,080
Here, brother-in-law.
来，姐夫

1321
01:37:52,160 --> 01:37:53,520
-Drink.
-Drink.
-喝
-喝

1322
01:37:54,200 --> 01:37:55,640
-Drink up.
-Drink.
-喝呀
-喝

1323
01:38:25,200 --> 01:38:27,400
Brother-in-law... are you two awake?
姐夫…你俩醒没有？

1324
01:38:27,880 --> 01:38:29,280
Get up, pull yourselves together.
赶紧起来精神精神

1325
01:38:29,760 --> 01:38:31,800
A real man can bend and rise again.
大丈夫能屈能伸

1326
01:38:31,880 --> 01:38:33,360
Get up, it's a new day.
起来又是新的一天

1327
01:38:34,560 --> 01:38:36,480
Bought you breakfast, wait for me to get back.
给你买早点了，等我回来

1328
01:38:41,960 --> 01:38:43,400
Sir, are you extending the room?
老哥，您这还续不？

1329
01:38:43,480 --> 01:38:45,520
It's the end of our shift, we've got to clock off.
这我们到点了，得下班了

1330
01:38:45,600 --> 01:38:46,760
No, we're done...
不续了…

1331
01:38:46,840 --> 01:38:49,600
-Okay, settle the bill?
-The bill...
-好，那买单？
-买单…

1332
01:38:49,680 --> 01:38:50,520
Pack these up...
打个包…

1333
01:38:50,600 --> 01:38:52,400
-Sure thing.
-Pack them separately.
-好咧，成
-分着放

1334
01:38:52,480 --> 01:38:53,560
-Okay.
-Okay...
-好，行
-好…

1335
01:38:54,800 --> 01:38:55,640
Captain Ma.
马队

1336
01:38:55,720 --> 01:38:56,640
Captain Ma.
马队

1337
01:38:57,160 --> 01:38:58,160
Wake up.
起来了

1338
01:38:58,800 --> 01:38:59,840
It's morning.
早晨了

1339
01:39:00,560 --> 01:39:01,960
Go home and sleep, Captain Ma.
回家睡去，马队

1340
01:39:02,040 --> 01:39:02,880
Captain Ma.
马队

1341
01:39:04,520 --> 01:39:08,400
What's a little pain in the wind and rain...
风雨中这点痛算什么

1342
01:39:08,480 --> 01:39:10,760
Wipe your tears, don't be afraid...
擦干泪，不要怕

1343
01:39:10,840 --> 01:39:13,320
At least we still have dreams...
至少我们还有梦

1344
01:39:14,840 --> 01:39:17,680
The results of Sports Lottery draw No. 16129.
体育彩票第16129期的开奖结果

1345
01:39:18,320 --> 01:39:20,360
Friends who missed yesterday's live drawing,
错过了昨天开奖直播的朋友

1346
01:39:20,440 --> 01:39:22,240
why not take out your ticket
不妨拿出您手中的彩票

1347
01:39:22,320 --> 01:39:24,320
and see if this draw's lucky jackpot winner
看看本期大奖的幸运得主

1348
01:39:24,400 --> 01:39:26,400
might just be you, there by your radio?
会不会是收音机前的您呢？

1349
01:39:27,120 --> 01:39:27,960
All right.
好了

1350
01:39:28,040 --> 01:39:30,520
This draw's winning numbers for the front zone of the Grand Lotto
本期大乐透前区开出的中奖号码

1351
01:39:30,600 --> 01:39:32,720
are: 07,
分别是07

1352
01:39:33,560 --> 01:39:36,120
-08, 19...
-Damn.
-08、19
-我去

1353
01:39:36,680 --> 01:39:39,320
30, 35.
30、35

1354
01:39:40,360 --> 01:39:47,080
07, 08, 19, 30, 35.
07、08、19、30、35

1355
01:39:47,640 --> 01:39:49,760
Now let's look at the winning numbers for the back zone.
现在我们来看后区开出的中奖号码

1356
01:39:50,320 --> 01:39:52,080
The first number is 08...
第一个数字是08…

1357
01:42:31,920 --> 01:42:33,000
Feeling better?
好点没？

1358
01:42:37,120 --> 01:42:38,240
What are you doing?
干啥呢？

1359
01:42:38,840 --> 01:42:40,200
Practicing holding your breath?
练闭气呢？

1360
01:42:57,560 --> 01:42:59,600
I didn't cancel the banquet.
那酒席我没退啊

1361
01:43:00,760 --> 01:43:03,240
Let's pick a good day and get married.
咱俩找个正日子把婚结了吧

1362
01:43:05,120 --> 01:43:06,360
Go.
你走吧

1363
01:43:11,760 --> 01:43:12,840
What?
啥玩意？

1364
01:43:13,440 --> 01:43:14,520
What did you say?
妳說啥呀？

1365
01:43:14,600 --> 01:43:16,120
Go.
你走吧

1366
01:43:16,720 --> 01:43:18,040
I lied to you.
我骗你了

1367
01:43:20,440 --> 01:43:23,160
What? Having second thoughts?
不是，怎么的？ 反悔了？

1368
01:43:23,720 --> 01:43:25,320
Don't want to marry me anymore?
不想嫁我了？

1369
01:43:27,760 --> 01:43:29,640
You look down on me.
你嫌弃我吧

1370
01:43:30,120 --> 01:43:32,880
I lied to you.
我骗你了

1371
01:43:42,520 --> 01:43:44,640
Don't bring it up, it's all in the past.
别提了，都翻篇了

1372
01:43:52,640 --> 01:43:53,960
From now on, I...
我以后…

1373
01:43:57,120 --> 01:43:59,520
I probably can't have children anymore.
可能不能再生孩子了

1374
01:44:02,800 --> 01:44:04,560
Then I want you all the more.
那我更得要妳了

1375
01:44:04,640 --> 01:44:06,640
No kids, then we'll raise something else.
没孩子就养点别的吧

1376
01:44:10,320 --> 01:44:11,640
You really want me?
你真要我？

1377
01:44:12,280 --> 01:44:13,840
Why would I lie to you?
骗妳干啥呀？

1378
01:44:13,920 --> 01:44:15,440
I even brought you flowers.
我花我都带来了

1379
01:44:19,360 --> 01:44:21,240
Your favorite calla lilies.
妳最喜欢的马蹄莲

1380
01:44:23,720 --> 01:44:25,280
You picked my flowers again.
你又薅我花了

1381
01:44:27,360 --> 01:44:28,760
This time I bought them.
这次是买的

1382
01:44:36,400 --> 01:44:37,920
Biaozi.
彪子

1383
01:44:45,960 --> 01:44:47,120
No more crying now.
不哭了
